declare
  v_items constant jsonb := $satx$[{"gid":"70d7115d-fbc0-5ec3-a9a7-0cd50d5f831d","subject":"SAT Math","format":"spr","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"equivalent_expressions","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"ee.polynomial_distribution.inverse/coefficient_inverse","group":"ee.polynomial_distribution.inverse","passage":"The equation below is true for all real values of t, where k is a constant.\n\n$(-2t - 3)(-4t + k) = 8t^2 + 26t + C$","question":"Find the value of C.","options":null,"correctIndex":null,"answers":["21"],"explanation":"(1) 곱을 전개하면 일차항 계수는 -2·k + (-3)·(-4) = -2k + 12 이다. (2) 식의 일차항 계수 26 와 비교하면 -2k + 12 = 26 이다. (3) 이 식을 풀면 k = -7 이다. (4) 상수항은 (-3)((-7)) = 21 이다. (5) 이차항 계수 -2·(-4) = 8 가 주어진 식과 같은지 확인한다. 따라서 정답은 21이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Expand the product and collect the coefficient of the linear term. (2) Equate it to the given linear coefficient. (3) Solve for k. (4) The constant term is b times k. (5) Check the quadratic coefficient. So the answer is 21.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T15:23:58.036Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["결과식의 계수를 주고 입력 상수를 역추적(계수 비교 → k → 상수항) — medium 은 주어진 식을 그대로 전개만 함"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"ee.polynomial_distribution.inverse","operator":"inverse","kind":"polynomial_distribution","extraThinking":"결과식의 계수를 주고 입력 상수를 역추적(계수 비교 → k → 상수항) — medium 은 주어진 식을 그대로 전개만 함","concepts":["다항식 곱 전개","계수 비교(항등식)","미지 상수 역산"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":3,"seed":810000,"variant":"coefficient_inverse","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":21,"correctOption":"21"},"runId":"sat-math-harder-20261020","gid":"70d7115d-fbc0-5ec3-a9a7-0cd50d5f831d","intendedSkill":"equivalent_expressions","recipeId":"ee.polynomial_distribution.inverse","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"b8573c52-71d3-56a1-ab89-025956df6e44","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"equivalent_expressions","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"ee.polynomial_distribution.constraint_select/rectangle_context","group":"ee.polynomial_distribution.constraint_select","passage":"A rectangular flag has area $4t^2 + 23t + 28$ square units. Both side lengths are linear in t with integer coefficients, and the longer side has the larger positive t-coefficient.","question":"What is the sum of the constant terms of the length and the width?","options":["11","-11","-29","29"],"correctIndex":0,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) $4$ 의 인수쌍 중 m > p > 0 인 후보를 나열한다. (2) 상수항 28 의 정수 인수쌍(부호 포함)을 나열한다. (3) 각 조합에서 중간항 m·q + n·p 를 계산해 일차항 계수와 비교한다. (4) 조건을 만족하는 조합은 (4t + 7)(t + 4) 하나뿐이다. (5) n + q = 7 + 4 = 11 이다. 따라서 정답은 11이다.","explanationEn":"(1) List the factor pairs of the leading coefficient with m > p > 0. (2) List integer factor pairs of the constant term, with signs. (3) For each combination compute mq + np and compare with the linear coefficient. (4) Exactly one combination works. (5) Add the constants. So the answer is 11.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T15:23:58.038Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["상수항의 인수쌍과 x^2 계수의 인수쌍을 시도해 중간항으로 선별하는 제약 탐색 — medium 은 전개 방향(분배) 한 번"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"ee.polynomial_distribution.constraint_select","operator":"constraint_select","kind":"polynomial_distribution","extraThinking":"상수항의 인수쌍과 x^2 계수의 인수쌍을 시도해 중간항으로 선별하는 제약 탐색 — medium 은 전개 방향(분배) 한 번","concepts":["이차식 인수분해(선행계수≠1)","인수쌍 탐색","제약 조건 선택"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":3,"seed":810000,"variant":"rectangle_context","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":11,"correctOption":"11"},"runId":"sat-math-harder-20261020","gid":"b8573c52-71d3-56a1-ab89-025956df6e44","intendedSkill":"equivalent_expressions","recipeId":"ee.polynomial_distribution.constraint_select","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"38c9a832-3de0-54ee-adce-0d50f5c352c9","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"equivalent_expressions","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"ee.polynomial_distribution.repr_shift/border_area","group":"ee.polynomial_distribution.repr_shift","passage":"The dimensions of a rectangular tablecloth are $t + 2$ centimeters and $4t + 8$ centimeters. A uniform strip of 4 centimeters (a lace edge) is added along every edge of the tablecloth.","question":"Which expression represents the area of the lace edge, in square centimeters?","options":["$40t + 80$","$20t + 56$","$4t^2 + 56t + 160$","$40t + 144$"],"correctIndex":3,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) 바깥 직사각형의 길이는 t + 2 + 2·4, 너비는 4t + 8 + 2·4 이다. (2) 바깥 넓이 = $(t + 10)(4t + 16)$ 를 전개한다. (3) 안쪽 넓이 = $(t + 2)(4t + 8)$ 를 전개한다. (4) 바깥 넓이에서 안쪽 넓이를 빼면 $t^2$ 항이 사라진다. (5) 동류항을 정리하면 $40t + 144$ 이다. 따라서 정답은 $40t + 144$이다.","explanationEn":"(1) The outer dimensions are each larger by twice the width. (2) Expand the outer area. (3) Expand the inner area. (4) Subtract: the quadratic terms cancel. (5) Combine like terms. So the answer is $40t + 144$.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T15:23:58.040Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["문장→식 변환(바깥 변 = 안 변 + 2w)과 모서리 정사각형 4w² 포함 여부 판단 — medium 은 주어진 식의 전개"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"ee.polynomial_distribution.repr_shift","operator":"repr_shift","kind":"polynomial_distribution","extraThinking":"문장→식 변환(바깥 변 = 안 변 + 2w)과 모서리 정사각형 4w² 포함 여부 판단 — medium 은 주어진 식의 전개","concepts":["도형의 넓이 모델링","이항식 곱 전개","동류항 정리"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":3,"seed":810000,"variant":"border_area","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":264,"correctOption":"$40t + 144$"},"runId":"sat-math-harder-20261020","gid":"38c9a832-3de0-54ee-adce-0d50f5c352c9","intendedSkill":"equivalent_expressions","recipeId":"ee.polynomial_distribution.repr_shift","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"43021903-7490-557a-a673-c4fa425becdb","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"equivalent_expressions","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"ee.rational_equivalence.inverse/difference","group":"ee.rational_equivalence.inverse","passage":"To integrate a fraction, a student rewrites it as the sum below for constants A and B, valid wherever the denominators are nonzero.\n\n$\\frac{x - 3}{(x + 4)(x + 5)} = \\frac{A}{x + 4} + \\frac{B}{x + 5}$","question":"What is the value of A - B?","options":["-15","15","1","-7"],"correctIndex":0,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) 양변에 분모 $(x + 4)(x + 5)$ 를 곱해 분모를 없앤다. (2) $x - 3 = A(x + 5) + B(x + 4)$ 를 얻는다. (3) x = -4 를 대입하면 좌변의 분자는 -7, 우변은 A(1) 이므로 A = -7 이다. (4) x = -5 를 대입하면 좌변의 분자는 -8, 우변은 B(-1) 이므로 B = 8 이다. (5) 일차항 계수 A + B = 1 이 분자의 계수와 같은지 확인한다. (6) A − B = -7 − 8 = -15 이다. 따라서 정답은 -15이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Multiply both sides by the common denominator. (2) This gives a polynomial identity. (3) Substitute the zero of the first factor to isolate A. (4) Substitute the zero of the second factor to isolate B. (5) Check with the linear coefficient. (6) Compute the requested value. So the answer is -15.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T15:23:58.041Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["공통분모를 '만드는' 방향이 아니라 분해 방향(미지수 A, B 역산): 양변에 분모를 곱하고 근을 대입하거나 계수 비교 — medium 은 공통분모로 결합"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"ee.rational_equivalence.inverse","operator":"inverse","kind":"rational_equivalence","extraThinking":"공통분모를 '만드는' 방향이 아니라 분해 방향(미지수 A, B 역산): 양변에 분모를 곱하고 근을 대입하거나 계수 비교 — medium 은 공통분모로 결합","concepts":["유리식 공통분모","항등식 계수 비교","부분분수 분해"],"steps":6,"mediumSteps":4,"seed":810000,"variant":"difference","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":-15,"correctOption":"-15"},"runId":"sat-math-harder-20261020","gid":"43021903-7490-557a-a673-c4fa425becdb","intendedSkill":"equivalent_expressions","recipeId":"ee.rational_equivalence.inverse","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"68e0e1a5-539a-5a6a-a03b-c89b05fb9b53","subject":"SAT Math","format":"spr","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"equivalent_expressions","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"ee.polynomial_distribution.inverse/coefficient_inverse","group":"ee.polynomial_distribution.inverse","passage":"Suppose k is a constant for which the equation below is an identity in x.\n\n$(5x - 4)(4x + k) = 20x^2 + 9x + D$","question":"Find the value of D.","options":null,"correctIndex":null,"answers":["-20"],"explanation":"(1) 곱을 전개하면 일차항 계수는 5·k + (-4)·4 = 5k + (-16) 이다. (2) 식의 일차항 계수 9 와 비교하면 5k + (-16) = 9 이다. (3) 이 식을 풀면 k = 5 이다. (4) 상수항은 (-4)(5) = -20 이다. (5) 이차항 계수 5·4 = 20 가 주어진 식과 같은지 확인한다. 따라서 정답은 -20이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Expand the product and collect the coefficient of the linear term. (2) Equate it to the given linear coefficient. (3) Solve for k. (4) The constant term is b times k. (5) Check the quadratic coefficient. So the answer is -20.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T15:23:58.041Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["결과식의 계수를 주고 입력 상수를 역추적(계수 비교 → k → 상수항) — medium 은 주어진 식을 그대로 전개만 함"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"ee.polynomial_distribution.inverse","operator":"inverse","kind":"polynomial_distribution","extraThinking":"결과식의 계수를 주고 입력 상수를 역추적(계수 비교 → k → 상수항) — medium 은 주어진 식을 그대로 전개만 함","concepts":["다항식 곱 전개","계수 비교(항등식)","미지 상수 역산"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":3,"seed":810001,"variant":"coefficient_inverse","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":-20,"correctOption":"-20"},"runId":"sat-math-harder-20261020","gid":"68e0e1a5-539a-5a6a-a03b-c89b05fb9b53","intendedSkill":"equivalent_expressions","recipeId":"ee.polynomial_distribution.inverse","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"1a3f0004-fbd5-5913-a974-8dd2560ac3a0","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"equivalent_expressions","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"ee.rational_equivalence.param_condition/ask_sum","group":"ee.rational_equivalence.param_condition","passage":"Constants c and d are chosen so that the two sides below agree at every allowed value of t.\n\n$\\frac{t^2 + ct + 18}{t - 3} = t + d$","question":"What is the sum of c and d?","options":["15","-15","-12","-9"],"correctIndex":1,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) 이 식이 분모의 영점을 제외한 모든 값에서 성립하려면 분자가 분모 인수로 나누어떨어져야 한다. (2) 즉 분자 = $(t - 3)(t + d)$ 이다. (3) 우변을 전개하면 $t^2 + (d - 3)t - 3d$ 이다. (4) 상수항을 비교하면 -(3)d = 18 이므로 d = -6 이다. (5) 일차항 계수를 비교하면 c = d - (3) = -9 이다. (6) 구하는 값은 -15 이다. 따라서 정답은 -15이다.","explanationEn":"(1) For the equality to hold, the numerator must be divisible by the denominator. (2) So the numerator factors as (x - r)(x + s). (3) Expand the right side. (4) Compare constants to find s. (5) Compare the linear coefficients to find k. (6) Report the requested value. So the answer is -15.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T15:23:58.042Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["동치가 되려면 나머지가 0(인수정리)이어야 한다는 암묵 조건 도출 후 계수 비교 — medium 은 주어진 두 유리식의 결합"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"ee.rational_equivalence.param_condition","operator":"param_condition","kind":"rational_equivalence","extraThinking":"동치가 되려면 나머지가 0(인수정리)이어야 한다는 암묵 조건 도출 후 계수 비교 — medium 은 주어진 두 유리식의 결합","concepts":["유리식 동치 조건","인수정리·다항식 나눗셈","계수 비교"],"steps":6,"mediumSteps":4,"seed":810000,"variant":"ask_sum","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":-15,"correctOption":"-15"},"runId":"sat-math-harder-20261020","gid":"1a3f0004-fbd5-5913-a974-8dd2560ac3a0","intendedSkill":"equivalent_expressions","recipeId":"ee.rational_equivalence.param_condition","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"e107c3c6-9633-5ea9-ae47-808192d9e475","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"equivalent_expressions","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"ee.rational_equivalence.constraint_select/excluded_values_sum","group":"ee.rational_equivalence.constraint_select","passage":"The expression below is equivalent to $\\frac{z - 6}{z + 4}$ for all values of z for which the original expression is defined.\n\n$\\frac{z^2 - 9z + 18}{z^2 + z - 12}$","question":"What is the sum of all values of z for which the original expression is undefined?","options":["1","-4","-1","-12"],"correctIndex":2,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) 분자를 인수분해한다: $z^2 - 9z + 18 = (z - 3)(z - 6)$. (2) 분모를 인수분해한다: $z^2 + z - 12 = (z - 3)(z + 4)$. (3) 공통인수 $(z - 3)$ 를 약분하면 $\\frac{z - 6}{z + 4}$ 이 된다. (4) 원래 식의 분모가 0 이 되는 값은 z = 3 와 z = -4 두 개이다(약분된 인수의 영점도 포함). (5) 두 값의 합은 3 + (-4) = -1 이다. 따라서 정답은 -1이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Factor the numerator. (2) Factor the denominator. (3) Cancel the common factor. (4) The original denominator is zero at both roots. (5) Add the excluded values. So the answer is -1.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T15:23:58.043Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["약분해 사라진 인수도 원식에서는 제외값이라는 정의역 제약 추적 — medium 은 동치 결합만 요구하고 제외값을 묻지 않음"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"ee.rational_equivalence.constraint_select","operator":"constraint_select","kind":"rational_equivalence","extraThinking":"약분해 사라진 인수도 원식에서는 제외값이라는 정의역 제약 추적 — medium 은 동치 결합만 요구하고 제외값을 묻지 않음","concepts":["유리식 약분","이차식 인수분해","정의역(제외값)"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":4,"seed":810000,"variant":"excluded_values_sum","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":-1,"correctOption":"-1"},"runId":"sat-math-harder-20261020","gid":"e107c3c6-9633-5ea9-ae47-808192d9e475","intendedSkill":"equivalent_expressions","recipeId":"ee.rational_equivalence.constraint_select","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"83060a37-d885-5448-a00b-588ac2525cb6","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"equivalent_expressions","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"ee.coefficient_matching.compose_kind/constant_after_difference","group":"ee.coefficient_matching.compose_kind","passage":"Simplify $(5z + 8)(5z - 8) - (6z + 8)^2$ into the form $Pz^2 + Qz + R$, where P, Q, and R are constants.","question":"What is the value of R?","options":["-16","-128","0","128"],"correctIndex":1,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) 첫 곱은 차의 제곱 공식: (5z)² − 8². (2) 상수항은 −64. (3) 제곱항의 상수항은 64. (4) 빼므로 R = −64 − 64. (5) R = -128. 따라서 정답은 -128이다.","explanationEn":"(1) The first product is a difference of squares. (2) Its constant term is -64. (3) The square's constant term is 64. (4) Subtracting gives R = -64 - 64. (5) R = -128. So the answer is -128.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T15:23:58.043Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["전개 결과 전체가 아니라 필요한 계수만 선택적으로 합산하거나 1 을 대입하는 요령이 필요 — medium 은 이항식 하나를 전개"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"ee.coefficient_matching.compose_kind","operator":"compose_kind","kind":"coefficient_matching","extraThinking":"전개 결과 전체가 아니라 필요한 계수만 선택적으로 합산하거나 1 을 대입하는 요령이 필요 — medium 은 이항식 하나를 전개","concepts":["식의 전개","계수 비교","동류항 정리"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":3,"seed":810000,"variant":"constant_after_difference","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":-128,"correctOption":"-128"},"runId":"sat-math-harder-20261020","gid":"83060a37-d885-5448-a00b-588ac2525cb6","intendedSkill":"equivalent_expressions","recipeId":"ee.coefficient_matching.compose_kind","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"e5f665b2-c084-5c12-a672-0ea236cf0e53","subject":"SAT Math","format":"spr","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"equivalent_expressions","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"ee.coefficient_matching.chain2/perfect_square_k","group":"ee.coefficient_matching.chain2","passage":"A trinomial $t^2 + kt + 16$ is a perfect square, $(t + m)^2$, with k and m positive.","question":"What is the value of k?","options":null,"correctIndex":null,"answers":["8"],"explanation":"(1) t² + kt + 16 = (t + m)² = t² + 2mt + m². (2) m² = 16 이므로 m = 4 (양수). (3) 중간항 계수 k = 2m. (4) k = 2 × 4. (5) k = 8. 따라서 정답은 8이다.","explanationEn":"(1) t² + kt + 16 = (t + m)² = t² + 2mt + m². (2) m^2 = 16, so m = 4. (3) The middle coefficient is k = 2m. (4) k = 2 × 4. (5) k = 8. So the answer is 8.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T15:23:58.043Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["앞 단계에서 얻은 계수·인수가 다음 계산의 입력이 되는 2단계 — medium 은 한 번의 전개"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"ee.coefficient_matching.chain2","operator":"chain2","kind":"coefficient_matching","extraThinking":"앞 단계에서 얻은 계수·인수가 다음 계산의 입력이 되는 2단계 — medium 은 한 번의 전개","concepts":["식의 전개","계수 비교","동류항 정리"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":3,"seed":810000,"variant":"perfect_square_k","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":8,"correctOption":"8"},"runId":"sat-math-harder-20261020","gid":"e5f665b2-c084-5c12-a672-0ea236cf0e53","intendedSkill":"equivalent_expressions","recipeId":"ee.coefficient_matching.chain2","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"950512ac-71b9-595d-a717-adcecf33148a","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"equivalent_expressions","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"ee.exponent_radical_forms.inverse/exponent_unknown","group":"ee.exponent_radical_forms.inverse","passage":"Positive integer k makes $\\frac{(n^k)^3}{n^{3}}$ = $n^{18}$ true for every positive $n$.","question":"What integer is k?","options":["18","21","6","7"],"correctIndex":3,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) (n^k)³ = n^(3k). (2) 나눗셈은 지수를 뺀다: 3k − 3. (3) 3k − 3 = 18. (4) 3k = 21. (5) k = 7. 따라서 정답은 7이다.","explanationEn":"(1) (n^k)³ = n^(3k). (2) Division subtracts: 3k - 3. (3) 3k − 3 = 18. (4) 3k = 21. (5) k = 7. So the answer is 7.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T15:23:58.043Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["동치 식의 구조를 비교해 미지수를 풀어야 함 — medium 은 정방향 간단히 하기"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"ee.exponent_radical_forms.inverse","operator":"inverse","kind":"exponent_radical_forms","extraThinking":"동치 식의 구조를 비교해 미지수를 풀어야 함 — medium 은 정방향 간단히 하기","concepts":["지수법칙","근호와 분수식 변형","동치 변형"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":3,"seed":810000,"variant":"exponent_unknown","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":7,"correctOption":"7"},"runId":"sat-math-harder-20261020","gid":"950512ac-71b9-595d-a717-adcecf33148a","intendedSkill":"equivalent_expressions","recipeId":"ee.exponent_radical_forms.inverse","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"c367c9f7-5853-59db-afc5-c869dc860139","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"equivalent_expressions","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"ee.identity_parameters.compose_kind/linear_identity_constant","group":"ee.identity_parameters.compose_kind","passage":"Distribute and combine like terms in $6(n - 6) + -5(n - 5)$ to obtain $Rn + C$.","question":"What is the value of C?","options":["-61","1","-5","-11"],"correctIndex":3,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) 6(n + -6) = 6n + -36. (2) -5(n − 5) = -5n − -25. (3) 두 식을 더하면 상수항끼리 합쳐진다. (4) -36 + (25). (5) C = -11. 따라서 정답은 -11이다.","explanationEn":"(1) 6(n + -6) = 6n + -36. (2) -5(n − 5) = -5n − -25. (3) Constant terms combine. (4) -36 + (25). (5) C = -11. So the answer is -11.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T15:23:58.044Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["양변을 전개·통분해 계수끼리 맞춰야 함 — medium 은 한 식의 전개"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"ee.identity_parameters.compose_kind","operator":"compose_kind","kind":"identity_parameters","extraThinking":"양변을 전개·통분해 계수끼리 맞춰야 함 — medium 은 한 식의 전개","concepts":["항등식","계수 비교로 상수 결정","동치 조건"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":3,"seed":810000,"variant":"linear_identity_constant","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":-11,"correctOption":"-11"},"runId":"sat-math-harder-20261020","gid":"c367c9f7-5853-59db-afc5-c869dc860139","intendedSkill":"equivalent_expressions","recipeId":"ee.identity_parameters.compose_kind","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"a80d1e54-0b6c-52d8-a845-3e3bc47ef3b4","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"equivalent_expressions","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"ee.polynomial_distribution.inverse/coefficient_inverse","group":"ee.polynomial_distribution.inverse","passage":"Suppose k is a constant for which the equation below is an identity in n.\n\n$(-4n + 4)(n + k) = -4n^2 + 24n + C$","question":"Find the value of C.","options":["-20","20","-1","-5"],"correctIndex":0,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) 곱을 전개하면 일차항 계수는 -4·k + 4·1 = -4k + 4 이다. (2) 식의 일차항 계수 24 와 비교하면 -4k + 4 = 24 이다. (3) 이 식을 풀면 k = -5 이다. (4) 상수항은 (4)((-5)) = -20 이다. (5) 이차항 계수 -4·1 = -4 가 주어진 식과 같은지 확인한다. 따라서 정답은 -20이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Expand the product and collect the coefficient of the linear term. (2) Equate it to the given linear coefficient. (3) Solve for k. (4) The constant term is b times k. (5) Check the quadratic coefficient. So the answer is -20.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T15:23:58.044Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["결과식의 계수를 주고 입력 상수를 역추적(계수 비교 → k → 상수항) — medium 은 주어진 식을 그대로 전개만 함"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"ee.polynomial_distribution.inverse","operator":"inverse","kind":"polynomial_distribution","extraThinking":"결과식의 계수를 주고 입력 상수를 역추적(계수 비교 → k → 상수항) — medium 은 주어진 식을 그대로 전개만 함","concepts":["다항식 곱 전개","계수 비교(항등식)","미지 상수 역산"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":3,"seed":810000,"variant":"coefficient_inverse","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":-20,"correctOption":"-20"},"runId":"sat-math-harder-20261020","gid":"a80d1e54-0b6c-52d8-a845-3e3bc47ef3b4","intendedSkill":"equivalent_expressions","recipeId":"ee.polynomial_distribution.inverse","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"fc5c5262-ce24-5df4-aeb5-0920115990ca","subject":"SAT Math","format":"spr","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"equivalent_expressions","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"ee.polynomial_distribution.constraint_select/rectangle_context","group":"ee.polynomial_distribution.constraint_select","passage":"The area of a rectangular garden bed, in square units, is given by $6n^2 - 17n + 12$. Its length and width are each of the form $mn + n$, with integer coefficients, and the length's n-coefficient is larger than the width's n-coefficient, which is positive.","question":"What is the total of the constant terms in the two dimensions?","options":null,"correctIndex":null,"answers":["-7"],"explanation":"(1) $6$ 의 인수쌍 중 m > p > 0 인 후보를 나열한다. (2) 상수항 12 의 정수 인수쌍(부호 포함)을 나열한다. (3) 각 조합에서 중간항 m·q + n·p 를 계산해 일차항 계수와 비교한다. (4) 조건을 만족하는 조합은 (3n - 4)(2n - 3) 하나뿐이다. (5) n + q = -4 + (-3) = -7 이다. 따라서 정답은 -7이다.","explanationEn":"(1) List the factor pairs of the leading coefficient with m > p > 0. (2) List integer factor pairs of the constant term, with signs. (3) For each combination compute mq + np and compare with the linear coefficient. (4) Exactly one combination works. (5) Add the constants. So the answer is -7.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T15:23:58.044Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["상수항의 인수쌍과 x^2 계수의 인수쌍을 시도해 중간항으로 선별하는 제약 탐색 — medium 은 전개 방향(분배) 한 번"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"ee.polynomial_distribution.constraint_select","operator":"constraint_select","kind":"polynomial_distribution","extraThinking":"상수항의 인수쌍과 x^2 계수의 인수쌍을 시도해 중간항으로 선별하는 제약 탐색 — medium 은 전개 방향(분배) 한 번","concepts":["이차식 인수분해(선행계수≠1)","인수쌍 탐색","제약 조건 선택"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":3,"seed":810001,"variant":"rectangle_context","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":-7,"correctOption":"-7"},"runId":"sat-math-harder-20261020","gid":"fc5c5262-ce24-5df4-aeb5-0920115990ca","intendedSkill":"equivalent_expressions","recipeId":"ee.polynomial_distribution.constraint_select","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"c8cc9074-9847-5b50-a124-6fee0b69259f","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Algebra (선형식·연립·부등식)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"linear_equations_one_var","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"le.solve.param_condition/infinitely_many","group":"le.solve.param_condition","passage":"Consider the equation below, where p and q are constants. Every real number is a solution of the equation.\n\n$p(y - 4) + q = -(y + 2) - 2$","question":"What is the value of p + q?","options":["-9","-8","-1","3"],"correctIndex":0,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) 좌변을 분배하면 $py - 4p + q$ 이다. (2) 우변을 분배하면 $-y - 4$ 이다. (3) 해가 무수히 많으려면 양변이 항등식이어야 하므로 $y$ 의 계수가 같아야 한다: p = -1. (4) 상수항도 같아야 한다: -4p + q = -4. (5) p = -1 를 대입하면 q = -4 - 4 = -8 이다. (6) p + q = -1 + (-8) = -9 이다. 따라서 정답은 -9이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Distribute on the left. (2) Distribute on the right. (3) Infinitely many solutions require an identity, so the coefficients must match. (4) The constants must match too. (5) Substitute to find the second constant. (6) Add. So the answer is -9.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T15:23:58.044Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["'해가 무수히 많다/없다'를 x 계수 일치 + 상수항 일치(불일치)라는 두 조건으로 번역 — medium 은 해를 하나 구하는 풀이"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"le.solve.param_condition","operator":"param_condition","kind":"solve","extraThinking":"'해가 무수히 많다/없다'를 x 계수 일치 + 상수항 일치(불일치)라는 두 조건으로 번역 — medium 은 해를 하나 구하는 풀이","concepts":["해의 개수 조건","분배·동류항 정리","항등식 계수 비교"],"steps":6,"mediumSteps":3,"seed":810000,"variant":"infinitely_many","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":-9,"correctOption":"-9"},"runId":"sat-math-harder-20261020","gid":"c8cc9074-9847-5b50-a124-6fee0b69259f","intendedSkill":"linear_equations_one_var","recipeId":"le.solve.param_condition","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"a439e4c2-6409-520a-ab14-4b5a89c5619e","subject":"SAT Math","format":"spr","skillType":"Algebra (선형식·연립·부등식)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"linear_equations_one_var","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"le.solve.constraint_select/count_solutions","group":"le.solve.constraint_select","passage":"The equation below is defined for all real x except one value.\n\n$\\frac{x - 4}{x + 6} = 2 + \\frac{-10}{x + 6}$","question":"How many real solutions does the equation have?","options":null,"correctIndex":null,"answers":["0"],"explanation":"(1) 분모 x + 6 가 0 이 되는 x = -6 는 정의역에서 제외한다. (2) 양변에 $x + 6$ 를 곱한다. (3) x - 4 = 2(x + 6) + (-10) 이다. (4) 정리하면 -1x = 6 이다. (5) x = -6 를 얻는다. (6) 이 값이 제외한 x = -6 와 같으므로 외래근이다. 해는 없다. 따라서 정답은 0이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Note the excluded value from the denominator. (2) Multiply both sides by the denominator. (3) Get a linear equation. (4) Collect terms. (5) Solve. (6) Check against the excluded value. So the answer is 0.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T15:23:58.045Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["분모에 변수가 있는 방정식의 정의역 제약과 외래근 판별 — medium 은 분모에 변수가 없는 일차방정식"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"le.solve.constraint_select","operator":"constraint_select","kind":"solve","extraThinking":"분모에 변수가 있는 방정식의 정의역 제약과 외래근 판별 — medium 은 분모에 변수가 없는 일차방정식","concepts":["유리방정식","정의역 제약","외래근 판별"],"steps":6,"mediumSteps":3,"seed":810000,"variant":"count_solutions","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":0,"correctOption":"0"},"runId":"sat-math-harder-20261020","gid":"a439e4c2-6409-520a-ab14-4b5a89c5619e","intendedSkill":"linear_equations_one_var","recipeId":"le.solve.constraint_select","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"8bfc3f27-4900-53ee-a2c2-37559d757641","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Algebra (선형식·연립·부등식)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"linear_equations_one_var","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"le.solve.chain2/relation_4_less_than","group":"le.solve.chain2","passage":"The equation $-2y - 8 = -10$ has a solution, which is called r. The solution of the equation $-2y + k = -29$ is 4 less than r, where k is a constant.","question":"Find the value of k.","options":["-35","-23","35","-27"],"correctIndex":0,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) 첫 방정식 $-2y - 8 = -10$ 를 풀면 r = 1 이다. (2) 둘째 방정식의 해는 \"4 less than r\" 이다. (3) 그 해는 1·1 + (-4) = -3 이다. (4) 둘째 방정식에 y = -3 를 대입한다: -2·(-3) + k = -29. (5) k = -29 - 6 = -35 이다. 따라서 정답은 -35이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Solve the first equation. (2) Translate the relation. (3) Compute the second solution. (4) Substitute into the second equation. (5) Solve for k. So the answer is -35.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T15:23:58.045Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["두 방정식의 해를 문장 관계로 연결하는 2단계 연쇄 — medium 은 방정식 하나의 해"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"le.solve.chain2","operator":"chain2","kind":"solve","extraThinking":"두 방정식의 해를 문장 관계로 연결하는 2단계 연쇄 — medium 은 방정식 하나의 해","concepts":["일차방정식 풀이","해 사이의 관계(문장→식)","대입으로 미지 상수 결정"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":3,"seed":810000,"variant":"relation_4_less_than","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":-35,"correctOption":"-35"},"runId":"sat-math-harder-20261020","gid":"8bfc3f27-4900-53ee-a2c2-37559d757641","intendedSkill":"linear_equations_one_var","recipeId":"le.solve.chain2","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"b398c4eb-0c8a-5835-ad78-91d92359a3b8","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Algebra (선형식·연립·부등식)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"linear_equations_one_var","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"le.solve.compose_kind/perimeter_to_area","group":"le.solve.compose_kind","passage":"A rectangular garden has a length of $3x$ meters and a width of $2x$ meters. Its perimeter is 30 meters.","question":"What is the area of the garden, in square meters?","options":["54","135","3","15"],"correctIndex":0,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) 둘레 = 2(가로 + 세로) 이므로 $2(3x + 2x) = 30$ 이다. (2) 괄호 안을 정리하면 $2(5x) = 30$ 이다. (3) 양변을 2 로 나누면 5x = 15 이다. (4) x = 3 를 얻는다. (5) 가로 = 9, 세로 = 6 이다. (6) 넓이 = 9 × 6 = 54 이다. 따라서 정답은 54이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Write the perimeter equation. (2) Combine like terms. (3) Divide by 2. (4) Solve. (5) Find the dimensions. (6) Multiply. So the answer is 54.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T15:23:58.045Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["일차방정식을 기하 공식(둘레→변→넓이)과 합성 — medium 은 방정식의 해 x 만 구함"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"le.solve.compose_kind","operator":"compose_kind","kind":"solve","extraThinking":"일차방정식을 기하 공식(둘레→변→넓이)과 합성 — medium 은 방정식의 해 x 만 구함","concepts":["일차방정식","직사각형 둘레","직사각형 넓이"],"steps":6,"mediumSteps":3,"seed":810000,"variant":"perimeter_to_area","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":54,"correctOption":"54"},"runId":"sat-math-harder-20261020","gid":"b398c4eb-0c8a-5835-ad78-91d92359a3b8","intendedSkill":"linear_equations_one_var","recipeId":"le.solve.compose_kind","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"65abfe71-e654-5b13-a909-002242902e4b","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Algebra (선형식·연립·부등식)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"linear_equations_one_var","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"le.word_problem_translate.chain2/consecutive_even_odd","group":"le.word_problem_translate.chain2","passage":"The total of four consecutive even integers is 48 more than twice the largest of the four.","question":"Which value is the greatest of these four even integers?","options":["108","30","24","26"],"correctIndex":1,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) 가장 작은 수를 x 라 하면 연속한 수는 x, x + 2, ..., x + 6 이다. (2) 합 = 4x + 12 이다. (3) 가장 큰 수는 x + 6 이다. (4) 문장을 식으로 쓰면 4x + 12 = 2(x + 6) + 48 이다. (5) 풀면 x = 24 이다. (6) 가장 큰 수는 24 + 6 = 30 이다. 따라서 정답은 30이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Let x be the smallest. (2) Sum of the terms. (3) Largest in terms of x. (4) Translate the relation. (5) Solve for x. (6) Compute the requested value. So the answer is 30.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T15:23:58.045Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["문장 관계(합 = α·최댓값 + β)를 변수 하나로 번역하는 두 겹의 식 세우기와 '묻는 수 ≠ 미지수' 재계산 — medium 은 한 번의 관계식"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"le.word_problem_translate.chain2","operator":"chain2","kind":"word_problem_translate","extraThinking":"문장 관계(합 = α·최댓값 + β)를 변수 하나로 번역하는 두 겹의 식 세우기와 '묻는 수 ≠ 미지수' 재계산 — medium 은 한 번의 관계식","concepts":["연속 정수 표현","문장→방정식","묻는 대상 재계산"],"steps":6,"mediumSteps":2,"seed":810000,"variant":"consecutive_even_odd","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":30,"correctOption":"30"},"runId":"sat-math-harder-20261020","gid":"65abfe71-e654-5b13-a909-002242902e4b","intendedSkill":"linear_equations_one_var","recipeId":"le.word_problem_translate.chain2","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"2789de97-47e4-5522-a132-dbcd844fe7cf","subject":"SAT Math","format":"spr","skillType":"Algebra (선형식·연립·부등식)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"linear_equations_one_var","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"le.word_problem_translate.unit_ratio/work_then_alone","group":"le.word_problem_translate.unit_ratio","passage":"It takes Rosa 8 hours to stock a warehouse alone. The same job would take Dev 30 hours alone. They work together for 4 hours, and then Rosa leaves and Dev finishes the rest of the job alone.","question":"From start to finish, how many hours are spent on the job?","options":null,"correctIndex":null,"answers":["15"],"explanation":"(1) Rosa의 작업률은 1/8, Dev의 작업률은 1/30 (전체 일 = 1) 이다. (2) 함께 4시간 일한 양은 4(1/8 + 1/30) = 152/240 이다. (3) 나머지 양은 1 - 152/240 = 88/240 이다. (4) Dev가 혼자 하는 시간 r 은 r/30 = 88/240 이므로 r = 11 이다. (5) 전체 시간은 4 + 11 = 15 시간이다. 따라서 정답은 15이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Set up the work rates. (2) Work done together. (3) Remaining work. (4) Time for the remaining work alone. (5) Add both phases. So the answer is 15.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T15:23:58.045Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["작업량=1 을 기준으로 한 작업률의 역수 모델링과 '함께 → 혼자' 두 구간 합성 — medium 은 한 번의 선형 관계식"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"le.word_problem_translate.unit_ratio","operator":"unit_ratio","kind":"word_problem_translate","extraThinking":"작업량=1 을 기준으로 한 작업률의 역수 모델링과 '함께 → 혼자' 두 구간 합성 — medium 은 한 번의 선형 관계식","concepts":["작업률(역수)","분수 방정식","구간 합성"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":2,"seed":810000,"variant":"work_then_alone","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":15,"correctOption":"15"},"runId":"sat-math-harder-20261020","gid":"2789de97-47e4-5522-a132-dbcd844fe7cf","intendedSkill":"linear_equations_one_var","recipeId":"le.word_problem_translate.unit_ratio","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"df0408bd-bda1-5400-a594-508bce275f82","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Algebra (선형식·연립·부등식)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"linear_equations_one_var","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"le.word_problem_translate.constraint_select/past_multiple","group":"le.word_problem_translate.constraint_select","passage":"At present, her son's age times 3 is Lena's age. Back then, 2 years ago, Lena was five times the age her son was.","question":"How old is her son now?","options":["12","4","2","6"],"correctIndex":1,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) her son의 현재 나이를 x, Lena의 나이를 3x 라 한다. (2) 2년 전 나이는 3x - 2 와 x - 2 이다. (3) 그때 관계: 3x - 2 = 5(x - 2) 이다. (4) 전개하면 3x - 2 = 5x - 10 이다. (5) 2x = 8 이므로 x = 4 이다. (6) 2년 전 her son의 나이 2 > 0 이므로 조건에 맞는다. 따라서 정답은 4이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Define the ages. (2) Past ages. (3) Set up the equation. (4) Expand. (5) Solve. (6) Check the constraint. So the answer is 4.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T15:23:58.045Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["시점이 다른 두 조건(현재·미래/과거)을 각각 식으로 번역하고 같은 변수로 연결 — medium 은 한 시점 관계"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"le.word_problem_translate.constraint_select","operator":"constraint_select","kind":"word_problem_translate","extraThinking":"시점이 다른 두 조건(현재·미래/과거)을 각각 식으로 번역하고 같은 변수로 연결 — medium 은 한 시점 관계","concepts":["시점별 나이 표현","문장→방정식","제약 확인"],"steps":6,"mediumSteps":2,"seed":810000,"variant":"past_multiple","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":4,"correctOption":"4"},"runId":"sat-math-harder-20261020","gid":"df0408bd-bda1-5400-a594-508bce275f82","intendedSkill":"linear_equations_one_var","recipeId":"le.word_problem_translate.constraint_select","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"12d6fd95-7154-566a-aaed-79380dff859d","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Algebra (선형식·연립·부등식)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"linear_equations_one_var","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"le.word_problem_translate.repr_shift/three_item_types","group":"le.word_problem_translate.repr_shift","passage":"Three kinds of items, nickels, dimes, and quarters, are kept in a jar. The number of nickels is twice the number of dimes. The number of quarters exceeds the number of dimes by 4. The total value is 280 cents. (A nickel is worth 5 cents, a dime 10 cents, and a quarter 25 cents.)","question":"What is the number of quarters?","options":["8","9","20","4"],"correctIndex":0,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) dimes의 개수를 d 라 하면 quarters는 d + 4, nickels는 2d 이다. (2) 가치를 더하면 5(2d) + 10d + 25(d + 4) = 280 이다. (3) 전개해 동류항을 모으면 45d + 100 = 280 이다. (4) 45d = 180 이므로 d = 4 이다. (5) quarters는 d + 4 = 8 개이다. 따라서 정답은 8이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Let d be the number of dimes. (2) Write the value equation. (3) Combine like terms. (4) Solve for d. (5) Compute the quantity asked. So the answer is 8.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T15:23:58.045Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["여러 미지수를 하나의 변수로 줄이는 번역(개수 관계)과 가치 가중합 식 — medium 은 한 종류 관계"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"le.word_problem_translate.repr_shift","operator":"repr_shift","kind":"word_problem_translate","extraThinking":"여러 미지수를 하나의 변수로 줄이는 번역(개수 관계)과 가치 가중합 식 — medium 은 한 종류 관계","concepts":["미지수 축소(변수 하나로 표현)","가치 가중합","문장→방정식"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":2,"seed":810000,"variant":"three_item_types","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":8,"correctOption":"8"},"runId":"sat-math-harder-20261020","gid":"12d6fd95-7154-566a-aaed-79380dff859d","intendedSkill":"linear_equations_one_var","recipeId":"le.word_problem_translate.repr_shift","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"6d7fee7e-e319-5921-adee-aad614eff8a6","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Algebra (선형식·연립·부등식)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"linear_equations_one_var","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"le.literal_rearrange.compose_kind/factor_then_substitute","group":"le.literal_rearrange.compose_kind","passage":"A certificate of deposit grows by simple interest according to $A = P + Prt$, where A is in dollars. In the formula, P stands for the starting balance, r for the annual rate in decimal form, and t for the number of years. After 6 years at an annual rate of 8%, the amount is 814 dollars.","question":"Find the starting balance, in dollars.","options":["754","766","550","17"],"correctIndex":2,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) P 가 두 항에 나오므로 P 로 묶는다: A = P(1 + rt). (2) P 에 대해 풀면 P = A / (1 + rt) 이다. (3) r = 8% = 0.08 이므로 rt = 0.08 × 6 = 0.48 이다. (4) 1 + rt = 1.48 이다. (5) P = 814 ÷ 1.48 = 550 이다. 따라서 정답은 550이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Factor P out of both terms. (2) Solve for P. (3) Convert the percent to a decimal. (4) Compute the factor. (5) Divide. So the answer is 550.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T15:23:58.045Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["목표 변수가 두 항에 나오므로 공통인수로 묶어 재배열(literal equation 의 핵심 함정)한 뒤 수치 대입 — medium 은 한 항의 이항·나눗셈"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"le.literal_rearrange.compose_kind","operator":"compose_kind","kind":"literal_rearrange","extraThinking":"목표 변수가 두 항에 나오므로 공통인수로 묶어 재배열(literal equation 의 핵심 함정)한 뒤 수치 대입 — medium 은 한 항의 이항·나눗셈","concepts":["리터럴 방정식 재배열","공통인수로 묶기","퍼센트→소수"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":3,"seed":810000,"variant":"factor_then_substitute","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":550,"correctOption":"550"},"runId":"sat-math-harder-20261020","gid":"6d7fee7e-e319-5921-adee-aad614eff8a6","intendedSkill":"linear_equations_one_var","recipeId":"le.literal_rearrange.compose_kind","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"9783e691-1b47-5ada-acc5-8ecbc4f54baf","subject":"SAT Math","format":"spr","skillType":"Algebra (선형식·연립·부등식)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"linear_equations_one_var","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"le.literal_rearrange.inverse/parallel_resistors","group":"le.literal_rearrange.inverse","passage":"Two resistors share the same two nodes, so the total resistance R obeys $\\frac{1}{R} = \\frac{1}{R_1} + \\frac{1}{R_2}$. The first resistor has a resistance of 20 ohms. A circuit has a total resistance of 15 ohms.","question":"What is the resistance, in ohms, of the other resistor?","options":null,"correctIndex":null,"answers":["60"],"explanation":"(1) 공식에 주어진 값을 넣으면 1/15 = 1/20 + 1/(미지수) 이다. (2) 구하려는 항을 한쪽으로 모은다: 1/미지수 = 1/15 − 1/20 이다. (3) 통분하면 5/300 이다. (4) 양변의 역수를 취한다. (5) 미지수 = 300/5 = 60 이다. 따라서 정답은 60이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Substitute the known values. (2) Isolate the reciprocal of the unknown. (3) Use a common denominator. (4) Take reciprocals. (5) Evaluate. So the answer is 60.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T15:23:58.046Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["분수식에서 변수가 분모에 있는 공식을 역수 형태로 재배열(통분 후 다시 뒤집기) — medium 은 분모에 변수가 없는 재배열"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"le.literal_rearrange.inverse","operator":"inverse","kind":"literal_rearrange","extraThinking":"분수식에서 변수가 분모에 있는 공식을 역수 형태로 재배열(통분 후 다시 뒤집기) — medium 은 분모에 변수가 없는 재배열","concepts":["역수 공식","분수 통분","리터럴 방정식 재배열"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":3,"seed":810000,"variant":"parallel_resistors","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":60,"correctOption":"60"},"runId":"sat-math-harder-20261020","gid":"9783e691-1b47-5ada-acc5-8ecbc4f54baf","intendedSkill":"linear_equations_one_var","recipeId":"le.literal_rearrange.inverse","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"3a9e38dc-817a-57eb-aaf0-e38267b186ae","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Algebra (선형식·연립·부등식)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"linear_equations_one_var","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"le.literal_rearrange.chain2/cooler","group":"le.literal_rearrange.chain2","passage":"The temperature in degrees Fahrenheit, F, is related to the temperature in degrees Celsius, C, by $F = \\frac{9}{5}C + 32$. The north shore is at 50 degrees Fahrenheit. On the Celsius scale, the south shore is 20 degrees lower than the north shore.","question":"What is the water temperature at the south shore, in degrees Fahrenheit?","options":["-10","30","14","-36"],"correctIndex":2,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) 50 - 32 = 18 이다. (2) 섭씨로 바꾸면 C = (5/9)(18) = 10 이다. (3) 낮으므로 섭씨 값은 10 - 20 = -10 이다. (4) 화씨로 되돌리면 (9/5)(-10) = -18 이다. (5) 32 를 더하면 F = 14 이다. 따라서 정답은 14이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Subtract 32 from the Fahrenheit value. (2) Convert to Celsius. (3) Apply the Celsius change. (4) Convert back. (5) Add 32. So the answer is 14.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T15:23:58.046Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["같은 공식을 역방향→변화량 적용→정방향으로 연쇄하고 '섭씨 변화량은 화씨로 9/5 배' 단위 규모를 구분 — medium 은 공식 한 번 적용"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"le.literal_rearrange.chain2","operator":"chain2","kind":"literal_rearrange","extraThinking":"같은 공식을 역방향→변화량 적용→정방향으로 연쇄하고 '섭씨 변화량은 화씨로 9/5 배' 단위 규모를 구분 — medium 은 공식 한 번 적용","concepts":["공식 역방향 사용","변화량과 절대값 구분","연쇄 환산"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":3,"seed":810000,"variant":"cooler","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":14,"correctOption":"14"},"runId":"sat-math-harder-20261020","gid":"3a9e38dc-817a-57eb-aaf0-e38267b186ae","intendedSkill":"linear_equations_one_var","recipeId":"le.literal_rearrange.chain2","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"c33297db-c8f9-5554-a016-b6d4dfecb7c4","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Algebra (선형식·연립·부등식)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"linear_equations_one_var","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"le.literal_rearrange.param_condition/collect_and_divide","group":"le.literal_rearrange.param_condition","passage":"The equation $5x - 16y = 9x + 20$ can be rewritten as $x = my + n$, where m and n are constants.","question":"Find m + n.","options":["9","1","4","-9"],"correctIndex":3,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) x 항을 왼쪽, 나머지를 오른쪽으로 모은다: -4x = 20 + 16y 이다. (2) 양변을 -4 로 나눈다. (3) x = (16/(-4))y + 20/(-4) 이다. (4) m = -4 이다. (5) n = -5 이다. (6) m + n = -9 이다. 따라서 정답은 -9이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Collect x terms on the left. (2) Divide by the coefficient. (3) Write the quotient. (4) Read m. (5) Read n. (6) Add. So the answer is -9.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T15:23:58.046Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["x 항을 한쪽으로 모아 공통인수 (a−c)로 묶어 나누고 y 계수·상수를 각각 읽어내는 재배열 — medium 은 한 변수 이항"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"le.literal_rearrange.param_condition","operator":"param_condition","kind":"literal_rearrange","extraThinking":"x 항을 한쪽으로 모아 공통인수 (a−c)로 묶어 나누고 y 계수·상수를 각각 읽어내는 재배열 — medium 은 한 변수 이항","concepts":["리터럴 방정식 재배열","공통인수 묶기","계수 읽기"],"steps":6,"mediumSteps":3,"seed":810000,"variant":"collect_and_divide","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":-9,"correctOption":"-9"},"runId":"sat-math-harder-20261020","gid":"c33297db-c8f9-5554-a016-b6d4dfecb7c4","intendedSkill":"linear_equations_one_var","recipeId":"le.literal_rearrange.param_condition","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"56382503-9aa6-5174-a009-80e52bf85c52","subject":"SAT Math","format":"spr","skillType":"Algebra (선형식·연립·부등식)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"linear_equations_one_var","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"leb.equation_applications.inverse/fraction_remaining_total","group":"leb.equation_applications.inverse","passage":"The following scenario comes from a short practice worksheet. Of all the marbles in a bag, 3/8 are used on the first day. On the second day, 2/3 of the marbles in a bag that were left after the first day are used. Exactly 15 marbles in a bag remain after the second day. A volunteer typed these facts into a shared spreadsheet.","question":"How many marbles in a bag were there at the start?","options":null,"correctIndex":null,"answers":["72"],"explanation":"(1) 처음 양을 T 라 하면 첫날 후 남은 양은 T × 5/8 이다. (2) 둘째 날 후 남은 양은 그 값 × 1/3 이다. (3) 즉 T × 5/8 × 1/3 = 15 이다. (4) 곱한 분수는 5/24 이다. (5) T = 15 × 24/5 = 72 이다. 따라서 정답은 72이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Amount left after the first day. (2) Amount left after the second day. (3) Set up the equation. (4) Multiply the fractions. (5) Solve. So the answer is 72.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T15:23:58.046Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["결과를 주고 시작 수량을 식으로 세워 역산해야 하는 역문제 — medium 은 시작 수량을 알고 결과를 계산"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"leb.equation_applications.inverse","operator":"inverse","kind":"equation_applications","extraThinking":"결과를 주고 시작 수량을 식으로 세워 역산해야 하는 역문제 — medium 은 시작 수량을 알고 결과를 계산","concepts":["방정식 모델링","역연산","단위·구성 해석"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":2,"seed":810000,"variant":"fraction_remaining_total","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":72,"correctOption":"72"},"runId":"sat-math-harder-20261020","gid":"56382503-9aa6-5174-a009-80e52bf85c52","intendedSkill":"linear_equations_one_var","recipeId":"leb.equation_applications.inverse","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"528e914d-46a0-5c48-a4e9-359d538fc175","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Algebra (선형식·연립·부등식)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"linear_equations_one_var","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"leb.equation_applications.chain2/convert_equal_fahrenheit","group":"leb.equation_applications.chain2","passage":"Think about the everyday situation described in this passage. For a desert thermometer, the Fahrenheit reading is 7 more than 2 times the Celsius reading. Temperatures in degrees Fahrenheit and Celsius are related by F = 9C/5 + 32. The facts above were reported by a reliable witness.","question":"What is the temperature in degrees Fahrenheit?","options":["125","258","257","225"],"correctIndex":2,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) 화씨 F 는 2C + 7 이고 F = 9C/5 + 32 이다. (2) 2C + 7 = 9C/5 + 32 이다. (3) 2C − 9C/5 = 25 이므로 1C/5 = 25 이다. (4) C = 125 이다. (5) F = 9 × 125/5 + 32 = 257 이다. 따라서 정답은 257이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Two expressions for F. (2) Set them equal. (3) Collect the C terms. (4) Solve for C. (5) Convert to Fahrenheit. So the answer is 257.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T15:23:58.046Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["방정식을 풀어 얻은 값을 다시 다른 양의 계산에 넣는 연쇄 — medium 은 방정식 하나의 해"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"leb.equation_applications.chain2","operator":"chain2","kind":"equation_applications","extraThinking":"방정식을 풀어 얻은 값을 다시 다른 양의 계산에 넣는 연쇄 — medium 은 방정식 하나의 해","concepts":["방정식 풀이","연쇄 계산","식 설정"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":2,"seed":810000,"variant":"convert_equal_fahrenheit","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":257,"correctOption":"257"},"runId":"sat-math-harder-20261020","gid":"528e914d-46a0-5c48-a4e9-359d538fc175","intendedSkill":"linear_equations_one_var","recipeId":"leb.equation_applications.chain2","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"043e7acd-894d-5c84-aadb-757a82295816","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Algebra (선형식·연립·부등식)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"linear_equations_one_var","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"le.solve.param_condition/infinitely_many","group":"le.solve.param_condition","passage":"Consider the equation below, where r and s are constants. The equation is true for all values of y.\n\n$r(y + 4) + s = 3(y - 3) + 8$","question":"What is the sum of r and s?","options":["-13","32","3","-10"],"correctIndex":3,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) 좌변을 분배하면 $ry + 4r + s$ 이다. (2) 우변을 분배하면 $3y - 1$ 이다. (3) 해가 무수히 많으려면 양변이 항등식이어야 하므로 $y$ 의 계수가 같아야 한다: r = 3. (4) 상수항도 같아야 한다: 4r + s = -1. (5) r = 3 를 대입하면 s = -1 - 12 = -13 이다. (6) r + s = 3 + (-13) = -10 이다. 따라서 정답은 -10이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Distribute on the left. (2) Distribute on the right. (3) Infinitely many solutions require an identity, so the coefficients must match. (4) The constants must match too. (5) Substitute to find the second constant. (6) Add. So the answer is -10.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T15:23:58.046Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["'해가 무수히 많다/없다'를 x 계수 일치 + 상수항 일치(불일치)라는 두 조건으로 번역 — medium 은 해를 하나 구하는 풀이"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"le.solve.param_condition","operator":"param_condition","kind":"solve","extraThinking":"'해가 무수히 많다/없다'를 x 계수 일치 + 상수항 일치(불일치)라는 두 조건으로 번역 — medium 은 해를 하나 구하는 풀이","concepts":["해의 개수 조건","분배·동류항 정리","항등식 계수 비교"],"steps":6,"mediumSteps":3,"seed":810001,"variant":"infinitely_many","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":-10,"correctOption":"-10"},"runId":"sat-math-harder-20261020","gid":"043e7acd-894d-5c84-aadb-757a82295816","intendedSkill":"linear_equations_one_var","recipeId":"le.solve.param_condition","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"ddb864b6-efb4-5f1e-a073-4df0dcad7ab7","subject":"SAT Math","format":"spr","skillType":"Algebra (선형식·연립·부등식)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"linear_equations_one_var","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"le.solve.constraint_select/count_solutions","group":"le.solve.constraint_select","passage":"Solve the equation below, keeping the excluded value in mind.\n\n$\\frac{m - 7}{m - 3} = 2 + \\frac{-4}{m - 3}$","question":"What is the number of real values of m that satisfy the equation?","options":null,"correctIndex":null,"answers":["0"],"explanation":"(1) 분모 m - 3 가 0 이 되는 m = 3 는 정의역에서 제외한다. (2) 양변에 $m - 3$ 를 곱한다. (3) m - 7 = 2(m - 3) + (-4) 이다. (4) 정리하면 -1m = -3 이다. (5) m = 3 를 얻는다. (6) 이 값이 제외한 m = 3 와 같으므로 외래근이다. 해는 없다. 따라서 정답은 0이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Note the excluded value from the denominator. (2) Multiply both sides by the denominator. (3) Get a linear equation. (4) Collect terms. (5) Solve. (6) Check against the excluded value. So the answer is 0.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T15:23:58.046Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["분모에 변수가 있는 방정식의 정의역 제약과 외래근 판별 — medium 은 분모에 변수가 없는 일차방정식"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"le.solve.constraint_select","operator":"constraint_select","kind":"solve","extraThinking":"분모에 변수가 있는 방정식의 정의역 제약과 외래근 판별 — medium 은 분모에 변수가 없는 일차방정식","concepts":["유리방정식","정의역 제약","외래근 판별"],"steps":6,"mediumSteps":3,"seed":810001,"variant":"count_solutions","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":0,"correctOption":"0"},"runId":"sat-math-harder-20261020","gid":"ddb864b6-efb4-5f1e-a073-4df0dcad7ab7","intendedSkill":"linear_equations_one_var","recipeId":"le.solve.constraint_select","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"c07c0fc9-48d7-5d08-a59e-4dcc4c711cb4","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Algebra (선형식·연립·부등식)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"linear_equations_one_var","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"le.solve.chain2/relation_three_times","group":"le.solve.chain2","passage":"Suppose r is the value of x that satisfies $-3x + 3 = 21$. In $-3x + k = 5$, k is a constant chosen so that the solution is three times r.","question":"What must k equal?","options":["-13","49","59","-49"],"correctIndex":3,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) 첫 방정식 $-3x + 3 = 21$ 를 풀면 r = -6 이다. (2) 둘째 방정식의 해는 \"three times r\" 이다. (3) 그 해는 3·(-6) + 0 = -18 이다. (4) 둘째 방정식에 x = -18 를 대입한다: -3·(-18) + k = 5. (5) k = 5 - 54 = -49 이다. 따라서 정답은 -49이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Solve the first equation. (2) Translate the relation. (3) Compute the second solution. (4) Substitute into the second equation. (5) Solve for k. So the answer is -49.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T15:23:58.047Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["두 방정식의 해를 문장 관계로 연결하는 2단계 연쇄 — medium 은 방정식 하나의 해"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"le.solve.chain2","operator":"chain2","kind":"solve","extraThinking":"두 방정식의 해를 문장 관계로 연결하는 2단계 연쇄 — medium 은 방정식 하나의 해","concepts":["일차방정식 풀이","해 사이의 관계(문장→식)","대입으로 미지 상수 결정"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":3,"seed":810001,"variant":"relation_three_times","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":-49,"correctOption":"-49"},"runId":"sat-math-harder-20261020","gid":"c07c0fc9-48d7-5d08-a59e-4dcc4c711cb4","intendedSkill":"linear_equations_one_var","recipeId":"le.solve.chain2","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"8f15c29f-85e0-5784-a553-ea539e2181c7","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Algebra (선형식·연립·부등식)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"linear_equations_one_var","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"le.solve.compose_kind/perimeter_to_area","group":"le.solve.compose_kind","passage":"The rectangular garden has a length of $5n$ meters and a width of $5n + 4$ meters. The distance around it is 108 meters.","question":"How many square meters does the garden cover?","options":["54","5","725","1350"],"correctIndex":2,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) 둘레 = 2(가로 + 세로) 이므로 $2(5n + 5n + 4) = 108$ 이다. (2) 괄호 안을 정리하면 $2(10n + 4) = 108$ 이다. (3) 양변을 2 로 나누면 10n + 4 = 54 이다. (4) n = 5 를 얻는다. (5) 가로 = 25, 세로 = 29 이다. (6) 넓이 = 25 × 29 = 725 이다. 따라서 정답은 725이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Write the perimeter equation. (2) Combine like terms. (3) Divide by 2. (4) Solve. (5) Find the dimensions. (6) Multiply. So the answer is 725.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T15:23:58.047Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["일차방정식을 기하 공식(둘레→변→넓이)과 합성 — medium 은 방정식의 해 x 만 구함"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"le.solve.compose_kind","operator":"compose_kind","kind":"solve","extraThinking":"일차방정식을 기하 공식(둘레→변→넓이)과 합성 — medium 은 방정식의 해 x 만 구함","concepts":["일차방정식","직사각형 둘레","직사각형 넓이"],"steps":6,"mediumSteps":3,"seed":810001,"variant":"perimeter_to_area","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":725,"correctOption":"725"},"runId":"sat-math-harder-20261020","gid":"8f15c29f-85e0-5784-a553-ea539e2181c7","intendedSkill":"linear_equations_one_var","recipeId":"le.solve.compose_kind","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"dd3f6228-0625-5fe3-ad7a-c65d8854ac04","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Algebra (선형식·연립·부등식)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"linear_equations_one_var","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"le.word_problem_translate.chain2/consecutive_integers","group":"le.word_problem_translate.chain2","passage":"The total of five consecutive integers equals 15 more than four times the largest of the five.","question":"What is the largest of the five integers?","options":["22","115","21","25"],"correctIndex":3,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) 가장 작은 수를 x 라 하면 연속한 수는 x, x + 1, ..., x + 4 이다. (2) 합 = 5x + 10 이다. (3) 가장 큰 수는 x + 4 이다. (4) 문장을 식으로 쓰면 5x + 10 = 4(x + 4) + 15 이다. (5) 풀면 x = 21 이다. (6) 가장 큰 수는 21 + 4 = 25 이다. 따라서 정답은 25이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Let x be the smallest. (2) Sum of the terms. (3) Largest in terms of x. (4) Translate the relation. (5) Solve for x. (6) Compute the requested value. So the answer is 25.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T15:23:58.047Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["문장 관계(합 = α·최댓값 + β)를 변수 하나로 번역하는 두 겹의 식 세우기와 '묻는 수 ≠ 미지수' 재계산 — medium 은 한 번의 관계식"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"le.word_problem_translate.chain2","operator":"chain2","kind":"word_problem_translate","extraThinking":"문장 관계(합 = α·최댓값 + β)를 변수 하나로 번역하는 두 겹의 식 세우기와 '묻는 수 ≠ 미지수' 재계산 — medium 은 한 번의 관계식","concepts":["연속 정수 표현","문장→방정식","묻는 대상 재계산"],"steps":6,"mediumSteps":2,"seed":810001,"variant":"consecutive_integers","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":25,"correctOption":"25"},"runId":"sat-math-harder-20261020","gid":"dd3f6228-0625-5fe3-ad7a-c65d8854ac04","intendedSkill":"linear_equations_one_var","recipeId":"le.word_problem_translate.chain2","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"cf6e45fa-9884-5090-a5d9-da3e94ce9585","subject":"SAT Math","format":"spr","skillType":"Algebra (선형식·연립·부등식)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"linear_equations_one_var","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"le.word_problem_translate.unit_ratio/work_then_alone","group":"le.word_problem_translate.unit_ratio","passage":"Rosa can stock a warehouse in 12 hours when working alone. Dev can do the same job alone in 30 hours. After 2 hours of working together, Rosa leaves and Dev alone finishes what is left.","question":"From start to finish, how many hours are spent on the job?","options":null,"correctIndex":null,"answers":["25"],"explanation":"(1) Rosa의 작업률은 1/12, Dev의 작업률은 1/30 (전체 일 = 1) 이다. (2) 함께 2시간 일한 양은 2(1/12 + 1/30) = 84/360 이다. (3) 나머지 양은 1 - 84/360 = 276/360 이다. (4) Dev가 혼자 하는 시간 r 은 r/30 = 276/360 이므로 r = 23 이다. (5) 전체 시간은 2 + 23 = 25 시간이다. 따라서 정답은 25이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Set up the work rates. (2) Work done together. (3) Remaining work. (4) Time for the remaining work alone. (5) Add both phases. So the answer is 25.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T15:23:58.047Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["작업량=1 을 기준으로 한 작업률의 역수 모델링과 '함께 → 혼자' 두 구간 합성 — medium 은 한 번의 선형 관계식"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"le.word_problem_translate.unit_ratio","operator":"unit_ratio","kind":"word_problem_translate","extraThinking":"작업량=1 을 기준으로 한 작업률의 역수 모델링과 '함께 → 혼자' 두 구간 합성 — medium 은 한 번의 선형 관계식","concepts":["작업률(역수)","분수 방정식","구간 합성"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":2,"seed":810001,"variant":"work_then_alone","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":25,"correctOption":"25"},"runId":"sat-math-harder-20261020","gid":"cf6e45fa-9884-5090-a5d9-da3e94ce9585","intendedSkill":"linear_equations_one_var","recipeId":"le.word_problem_translate.unit_ratio","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"e49140ab-54e1-507e-a895-78ad287b3d36","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Algebra (선형식·연립·부등식)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"linear_equations_one_var","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"le.word_problem_translate.constraint_select/future_sum","group":"le.word_problem_translate.constraint_select","passage":"Omar is three times as old as his niece. The total of their ages 4 years from today will be 24.","question":"How old is his niece now?","options":["5","12","4","8"],"correctIndex":2,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) his niece의 현재 나이를 x, Omar의 나이를 3x 라 한다. (2) 4년 뒤 나이는 3x + 4 와 x + 4 이다. (3) 합 = 4x + 8 = 24 이다. (4) 4x = 16 이므로 x = 4 이다. (5) his niece의 현재 나이는 4 이다. 따라서 정답은 4이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Define the ages. (2) Future ages. (3) Set up the equation. (4) Solve. (5) State the answer. So the answer is 4.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T15:23:58.047Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["시점이 다른 두 조건(현재·미래/과거)을 각각 식으로 번역하고 같은 변수로 연결 — medium 은 한 시점 관계"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"le.word_problem_translate.constraint_select","operator":"constraint_select","kind":"word_problem_translate","extraThinking":"시점이 다른 두 조건(현재·미래/과거)을 각각 식으로 번역하고 같은 변수로 연결 — medium 은 한 시점 관계","concepts":["시점별 나이 표현","문장→방정식","제약 확인"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":2,"seed":810001,"variant":"future_sum","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":4,"correctOption":"4"},"runId":"sat-math-harder-20261020","gid":"e49140ab-54e1-507e-a895-78ad287b3d36","intendedSkill":"linear_equations_one_var","recipeId":"le.word_problem_translate.constraint_select","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"4d239425-3a1e-5695-a9b6-578c1f1f688a","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Algebra (선형식·연립·부등식)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"linear_equations_one_var","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"le.word_problem_translate.repr_shift/three_item_types","group":"le.word_problem_translate.repr_shift","passage":"A bag of game chips is stocked with white chips, black chips, and gold chips and nothing else. The number of white chips is twice the number of black chips. Counting the gold chips gives 5 more than counting the black chips. The total value is 157 points. (A white chip is worth 1 point, a black chip 3 points, and a gold chip 8 points.)","question":"What is the number of gold chips?","options":["14","18","15","9"],"correctIndex":0,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) black chips의 개수를 d 라 하면 gold chips는 d + 5, white chips는 2d 이다. (2) 가치를 더하면 1(2d) + 3d + 8(d + 5) = 157 이다. (3) 전개해 동류항을 모으면 13d + 40 = 157 이다. (4) 13d = 117 이므로 d = 9 이다. (5) gold chips는 d + 5 = 14 개이다. 따라서 정답은 14이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Let d be the number of black chips. (2) Write the value equation. (3) Combine like terms. (4) Solve for d. (5) Compute the quantity asked. So the answer is 14.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T15:23:58.047Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["여러 미지수를 하나의 변수로 줄이는 번역(개수 관계)과 가치 가중합 식 — medium 은 한 종류 관계"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"le.word_problem_translate.repr_shift","operator":"repr_shift","kind":"word_problem_translate","extraThinking":"여러 미지수를 하나의 변수로 줄이는 번역(개수 관계)과 가치 가중합 식 — medium 은 한 종류 관계","concepts":["미지수 축소(변수 하나로 표현)","가치 가중합","문장→방정식"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":2,"seed":810001,"variant":"three_item_types","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":14,"correctOption":"14"},"runId":"sat-math-harder-20261020","gid":"4d239425-3a1e-5695-a9b6-578c1f1f688a","intendedSkill":"linear_equations_one_var","recipeId":"le.word_problem_translate.repr_shift","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"a08a41d6-111f-515d-a3cd-1325ad7a664f","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Algebra (선형식·연립·부등식)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"linear_equations_one_var","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"le.literal_rearrange.compose_kind/factor_then_substitute","group":"le.literal_rearrange.compose_kind","passage":"For a retirement fund earning simple interest, the total amount A in dollars is $A = P + Prt$. The deposit is P dollars, the annual rate is r (written as a decimal), and the time is t years. After 3 years at an annual rate of 2%, the amount is 848 dollars.","question":"What was the deposit, in dollars?","options":["141","831","842","800"],"correctIndex":3,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) P 가 두 항에 나오므로 P 로 묶는다: A = P(1 + rt). (2) P 에 대해 풀면 P = A / (1 + rt) 이다. (3) r = 2% = 0.02 이므로 rt = 0.02 × 3 = 0.06 이다. (4) 1 + rt = 1.06 이다. (5) P = 848 ÷ 1.06 = 800 이다. 따라서 정답은 800이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Factor P out of both terms. (2) Solve for P. (3) Convert the percent to a decimal. (4) Compute the factor. (5) Divide. So the answer is 800.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T15:23:58.047Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["목표 변수가 두 항에 나오므로 공통인수로 묶어 재배열(literal equation 의 핵심 함정)한 뒤 수치 대입 — medium 은 한 항의 이항·나눗셈"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"le.literal_rearrange.compose_kind","operator":"compose_kind","kind":"literal_rearrange","extraThinking":"목표 변수가 두 항에 나오므로 공통인수로 묶어 재배열(literal equation 의 핵심 함정)한 뒤 수치 대입 — medium 은 한 항의 이항·나눗셈","concepts":["리터럴 방정식 재배열","공통인수로 묶기","퍼센트→소수"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":3,"seed":810001,"variant":"factor_then_substitute","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":800,"correctOption":"800"},"runId":"sat-math-harder-20261020","gid":"a08a41d6-111f-515d-a3cd-1325ad7a664f","intendedSkill":"linear_equations_one_var","recipeId":"le.literal_rearrange.compose_kind","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"be369a29-2905-590c-a7c4-7e7bcf1c0980","subject":"SAT Math","format":"spr","skillType":"Algebra (선형식·연립·부등식)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"linear_equations_one_var","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"le.literal_rearrange.inverse/combined_time","group":"le.literal_rearrange.inverse","passage":"One job is handled by a pair of painters. Side by side, the two painters finish in 12 hours. On her own, the first painter needs 28 hours for the same job. The times satisfy $\\frac{1}{T} = \\frac{1}{a} + \\frac{1}{b}$, where T is the time together and a and b are the times alone.","question":"How many hours does the second painter need to do the job alone?","options":null,"correctIndex":null,"answers":["21"],"explanation":"(1) 공식에 주어진 값을 넣으면 1/12 = 1/28 + 1/(미지수) 이다. (2) 구하려는 항을 한쪽으로 모은다: 1/미지수 = 1/12 − 1/28 이다. (3) 통분하면 16/336 이다. (4) 양변의 역수를 취한다. (5) 미지수 = 336/16 = 21 이다. 따라서 정답은 21이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Substitute the known values. (2) Isolate the reciprocal of the unknown. (3) Use a common denominator. (4) Take reciprocals. (5) Evaluate. So the answer is 21.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T15:23:58.047Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["분수식에서 변수가 분모에 있는 공식을 역수 형태로 재배열(통분 후 다시 뒤집기) — medium 은 분모에 변수가 없는 재배열"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"le.literal_rearrange.inverse","operator":"inverse","kind":"literal_rearrange","extraThinking":"분수식에서 변수가 분모에 있는 공식을 역수 형태로 재배열(통분 후 다시 뒤집기) — medium 은 분모에 변수가 없는 재배열","concepts":["역수 공식","분수 통분","리터럴 방정식 재배열"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":3,"seed":810001,"variant":"combined_time","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":21,"correctOption":"21"},"runId":"sat-math-harder-20261020","gid":"be369a29-2905-590c-a7c4-7e7bcf1c0980","intendedSkill":"linear_equations_one_var","recipeId":"le.literal_rearrange.inverse","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"86ba7edb-7480-5630-a004-7eeef4c19421","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Algebra (선형식·연립·부등식)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"systems_linear","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"sl.substitution_solve.inverse/unknown_constant_by_substitution","group":"sl.substitution_solve.inverse","passage":"The system below has a constant c. One coordinate of the solution is known: $x = -5$.\n\n$y = -4x + 7$\n$cx + y = 22$","question":"Find c.","options":["-5","-10","1","-1"],"correctIndex":2,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) 첫 식에 x = -5 를 대입하면 y = -4·(-5) + 7 = 27 이다. (2) 해는 (-5, 27) 이다. (3) 둘째 식에 대입하면 c·(-5) + 1·27 = 22 이다. (4) 1·27 = 27 를 이항하면 c·(-5) = -5 이다. (5) c = -5/(-5) = 1 이다. 따라서 정답은 1이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Substitute x into the first equation. (2) State the solution. (3) Substitute into the second equation. (4) Isolate the constant's term. (5) Solve. So the answer is 1.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T15:23:58.048Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["해의 일부(x 좌표)에서 대입으로 나머지를 복원한 뒤 미지 계수를 결정하는 역방향 — medium 은 두 식이 모두 주어진 대입법"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"sl.substitution_solve.inverse","operator":"inverse","kind":"substitution_solve","extraThinking":"해의 일부(x 좌표)에서 대입으로 나머지를 복원한 뒤 미지 계수를 결정하는 역방향 — medium 은 두 식이 모두 주어진 대입법","concepts":["대입법","해의 의미","미지 상수 역산"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":4,"seed":810000,"variant":"unknown_constant_by_substitution","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":1,"correctOption":"1"},"runId":"sat-math-harder-20261020","gid":"86ba7edb-7480-5630-a004-7eeef4c19421","intendedSkill":"systems_linear","recipeId":"sl.substitution_solve.inverse","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"969734e3-a580-5e48-ae95-ceaaeaab23f1","subject":"SAT Math","format":"spr","skillType":"Algebra (선형식·연립·부등식)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"systems_linear","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"sl.substitution_solve.compose_kind/length_width_perimeter_area","group":"sl.substitution_solve.compose_kind","passage":"A rectangular courtyard has a length of x yards and a width of y yards. The courtyard is 7 yards longer than it is wide. The perimeter is 58 yards.","question":"How many square yards does the courtyard cover?","options":null,"correctIndex":null,"answers":["198"],"explanation":"(1) 연립식: $x = y + 7$ 와 $2x + 2y = 58$ 이다. (2) 첫 식을 둘째 식에 대입하면 $2(y + 7) + 2y = 58$ 이다. (3) 정리하면 $4y + 14 = 58$ 이므로 y = 11 이다. (4) x = 11 + 7 = 18 이다. (5) 넓이는 18 × 11 = 198 이다. 따라서 정답은 198이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Write the system. (2) Substitute. (3) Solve for y. (4) Find x. (5) Multiply. So the answer is 198.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T15:23:58.048Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["문장 조건을 연립으로 세워 대입으로 풀고 기하 공식(넓이)과 합성 — medium 은 두 식이 주어진 연립에서 한 값을 구함"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"sl.substitution_solve.compose_kind","operator":"compose_kind","kind":"substitution_solve","extraThinking":"문장 조건을 연립으로 세워 대입으로 풀고 기하 공식(넓이)과 합성 — medium 은 두 식이 주어진 연립에서 한 값을 구함","concepts":["대입법","직사각형 둘레","직사각형 넓이"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":4,"seed":810000,"variant":"length_width_perimeter_area","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":198,"correctOption":"198"},"runId":"sat-math-harder-20261020","gid":"969734e3-a580-5e48-ae95-ceaaeaab23f1","intendedSkill":"systems_linear","recipeId":"sl.substitution_solve.compose_kind","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"f32ef501-8c8d-5a02-a542-420a89140e1b","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Algebra (선형식·연립·부등식)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"systems_linear","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"sl.substitution_solve.repr_shift/sum_and_multiple_relation","group":"sl.substitution_solve.repr_shift","passage":"A pair of numbers has a sum of 43. One of them is 1 more than five times the other.","question":"What is the larger number?","options":["7","42","36","35"],"correctIndex":2,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) 작은 수를 x, 큰 수를 y 라 하면 $x + y = 43$ 이다. (2) '1 more than five times the lesser' 는 $y = 5x + 1$ 이다. (3) 대입하면 $x + 5x + 1 = 43$ 이다. (4) $6x = 42$ 이므로 x = 7 이다. (5) y = 5·7 + 1 = 36 이다. 따라서 정답은 36이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Define the variables and the sum equation. (2) Translate the relation. (3) Substitute. (4) Solve for x. (5) Find the larger number. So the answer is 36.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T15:23:58.048Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["문장 관계(m 배보다 k 큼)를 식으로 정확히 번역한 뒤 대입 — medium 은 식이 주어진 대입법"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"sl.substitution_solve.repr_shift","operator":"repr_shift","kind":"substitution_solve","extraThinking":"문장 관계(m 배보다 k 큼)를 식으로 정확히 번역한 뒤 대입 — medium 은 식이 주어진 대입법","concepts":["문장→연립방정식","대입법"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":4,"seed":810000,"variant":"sum_and_multiple_relation","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":36,"correctOption":"36"},"runId":"sat-math-harder-20261020","gid":"f32ef501-8c8d-5a02-a542-420a89140e1b","intendedSkill":"systems_linear","recipeId":"sl.substitution_solve.repr_shift","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":2,"minMet":2,"of":2,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"afacc719-1570-5c2b-a125-82240e84ff25","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Algebra (선형식·연립·부등식)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"systems_linear","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"sl.substitution_solve.chain2/three_variable_chain","group":"sl.substitution_solve.chain2","passage":"A system of three equations in p, q, and r is given below.\n\n$r = 3q$\n$p + q + r = 67$\n$q = p + 8$","question":"What does r equal?","options":["21","15","45","7"],"correctIndex":2,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) 둘째 식의 q = p + 8 를 r = 3q 에 대입하면 r = 3(p + 8) = 3p + 24 이다. (2) 합의 식에 q 와 r 를 모두 p 로 바꾼다: p + (p + 8) + (3p + 24) = 67. (3) 정리하면 $5p + 32 = 67$ 이다. (4) p = 7 이다. (5) q = 15, r = 3·15 = 45 이다. 따라서 정답은 45이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Substitute into the third equation. (2) Substitute both into the sum equation. (3) Combine like terms. (4) Solve for the first variable. (5) Back-substitute. So the answer is 45.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T15:23:58.048Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["한 변수를 다른 변수로 연쇄적으로 바꿔 넣는 다단계 대입(세 변수) — medium 은 두 변수 대입법"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"sl.substitution_solve.chain2","operator":"chain2","kind":"substitution_solve","extraThinking":"한 변수를 다른 변수로 연쇄적으로 바꿔 넣는 다단계 대입(세 변수) — medium 은 두 변수 대입법","concepts":["대입법","연쇄 대입","세 변수 연립"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":4,"seed":810000,"variant":"three_variable_chain","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":45,"correctOption":"45"},"runId":"sat-math-harder-20261020","gid":"afacc719-1570-5c2b-a125-82240e84ff25","intendedSkill":"systems_linear","recipeId":"sl.substitution_solve.chain2","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"2f64cf7e-048b-53dc-a294-7cb19a73f51b","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Algebra (선형식·연립·부등식)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"systems_linear","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"sl.elimination_value.inverse/unknown_coefficient_by_elimination","group":"sl.elimination_value.inverse","passage":"Consider the system below, where c is a constant. The x-coordinate of the solution to the system is 2.\n\n$-5x - 4y = -18$\n$cx - 5y = -6$","question":"What is the value of c?","options":["-3","2","-8","-2"],"correctIndex":1,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) 첫 식에 x = 2 를 대입하면 $-5\\cdot 2 - 4y = -18$ 이다. (2) 상수를 이항하면 $-4y = -8$ 이다. (3) y = 2 이다. (4) 둘째 식에 대입하면 c·2 + (-5)·2 = -6 이다. (5) c = (-6 - (-10)) / 2 = 2 이다. 따라서 정답은 2이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Substitute x into the first equation. (2) Isolate the y-term. (3) Solve for y. (4) Substitute into the second equation. (5) Solve. So the answer is 2.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T15:23:58.049Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["해의 일부에서 나머지를 복원한 뒤 미지 계수를 결정하는 역방향 — medium 은 두 식이 모두 주어진 소거법"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"sl.elimination_value.inverse","operator":"inverse","kind":"elimination_value","extraThinking":"해의 일부에서 나머지를 복원한 뒤 미지 계수를 결정하는 역방향 — medium 은 두 식이 모두 주어진 소거법","concepts":["소거법","해의 의미","미지 상수 역산"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":4,"seed":810000,"variant":"unknown_coefficient_by_elimination","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":2,"correctOption":"2"},"runId":"sat-math-harder-20261020","gid":"2f64cf7e-048b-53dc-a294-7cb19a73f51b","intendedSkill":"systems_linear","recipeId":"sl.elimination_value.inverse","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"be52cfd1-4490-5077-a46b-d86d00b6bba3","subject":"SAT Math","format":"spr","skillType":"Algebra (선형식·연립·부등식)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"systems_linear","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"sl.elimination_value.chain2/eliminate_then_evaluate_expression","group":"sl.elimination_value.chain2","passage":"Look at the following system of equations.\n\n$-3x + 2y = -20$\n$-x + 2y = -12$\n\nThe solution of the system is $(x, y)$.","question":"What does $5x + 2y$ equal?","options":null,"correctIndex":null,"answers":["12"],"explanation":"(1) 한 변수가 소거되도록 식에 적당한 수를 곱한다. (2) 두 식을 더하거나 빼 한 변수를 소거한다. (3) 남은 식을 풀어 x = 4 를 얻는다. (4) x = 4 를 한 식에 대입해 y = -4 를 얻는다. (5) $5\\cdot 4 + 2\\cdot (-4) = 12$ 이다. 따라서 정답은 12이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Scale the equations. (2) Add or subtract to eliminate. (3) Solve for x. (4) Back-substitute for y. (5) Evaluate the requested expression. So the answer is 12.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T15:23:58.049Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["소거→대입→식의 값으로 이어지는 3단계 연쇄(묻는 값이 해가 아닌 해의 결합) — medium 은 해 하나를 구함"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"sl.elimination_value.chain2","operator":"chain2","kind":"elimination_value","extraThinking":"소거→대입→식의 값으로 이어지는 3단계 연쇄(묻는 값이 해가 아닌 해의 결합) — medium 은 해 하나를 구함","concepts":["소거법","대입으로 나머지 구하기","식의 값 계산"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":4,"seed":810000,"variant":"eliminate_then_evaluate_expression","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":12,"correctOption":"12"},"runId":"sat-math-harder-20261020","gid":"be52cfd1-4490-5077-a46b-d86d00b6bba3","intendedSkill":"systems_linear","recipeId":"sl.elimination_value.chain2","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"56d750a2-bd79-5323-a78a-dd57b67a34ed","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Algebra (선형식·연립·부등식)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"systems_linear","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"sl.elimination_value.constraint_select/positive_integer_solutions_sum_of_k","group":"sl.elimination_value.constraint_select","passage":"For the system below, m is a whole number from 1 to 11. Some choices of m make both x and y positive whole numbers.\n\n$x + y = 13$\n$mx - y = 15$","question":"What is the sum of the values of m that work?","options":["3","2","9","16"],"correctIndex":2,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) 두 식을 더하면 y 가 소거된다: $(m + 1)x = 28$ 이다. (2) x = 28/(m + 1) 이 양의 정수여야 한다. (3) m + 1 은 28 의 약수여야 한다. (4) y = 13 - x 도 양수여야 하므로 x < 13 이다. (5) 조건을 모두 만족하는 m 는 3, 6 이고 합은 9 이다. 따라서 정답은 9이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Add the equations to eliminate y. (2) x must be a positive integer. (3) m + 1 must divide the sum. (4) y must also be positive. (5) Add the valid values. So the answer is 9.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T15:23:58.049Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["두 식을 더해 (k+1)x = c+d 로 만든 뒤 약수·양수 조건으로 후보 k 를 선별 — medium 은 해 하나를 구함"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"sl.elimination_value.constraint_select","operator":"constraint_select","kind":"elimination_value","extraThinking":"두 식을 더해 (k+1)x = c+d 로 만든 뒤 약수·양수 조건으로 후보 k 를 선별 — medium 은 해 하나를 구함","concepts":["소거법","약수 조건(정수 해)","후보 선택과 합산"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":4,"seed":810000,"variant":"positive_integer_solutions_sum_of_k","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":9,"correctOption":"9"},"runId":"sat-math-harder-20261020","gid":"56d750a2-bd79-5323-a78a-dd57b67a34ed","intendedSkill":"systems_linear","recipeId":"sl.elimination_value.constraint_select","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"c097d626-2864-54a0-a0f1-6f498e910c11","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Algebra (선형식·연립·부등식)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"systems_linear","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"sl.elimination_value.compare_scenarios/difference_of_two_solutions","group":"sl.elimination_value.compare_scenarios","passage":"System A and system B are described below. The equations of system A are $a + b = 8$ and $a - b = 16$. System B consists of the equations $a + b = 17$ and $a - b = -1$.","question":"What is the a-value of A's solution minus the a-value of B's solution?","options":["-4","4","20","-13"],"correctIndex":1,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) A 의 두 식을 더하면 $2a = 24$ 이므로 a = 12 이다. (2) A 의 b 는 8 - 12 = -4 이다. (3) B 의 두 식을 더하면 $2a = 16$ 이므로 a = 8 이다. (4) 두 해의 같은 좌표(첫째 변수)를 비교한다. (5) 12 - 8 = 4 이다. 따라서 정답은 4이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Solve A by adding. (2) Find A's second value. (3) Solve B by adding. (4) Compare the same coordinate. (5) Subtract. So the answer is 4.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T15:23:58.050Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["서로 다른 두 연립의 해를 각각 구해 비교(차) — medium 은 연립 하나의 해"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"sl.elimination_value.compare_scenarios","operator":"compare_scenarios","kind":"elimination_value","extraThinking":"서로 다른 두 연립의 해를 각각 구해 비교(차) — medium 은 연립 하나의 해","concepts":["소거법","두 해의 비교"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":4,"seed":810000,"variant":"difference_of_two_solutions","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":4,"correctOption":"4"},"runId":"sat-math-harder-20261020","gid":"c097d626-2864-54a0-a0f1-6f498e910c11","intendedSkill":"systems_linear","recipeId":"sl.elimination_value.compare_scenarios","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":2,"minMet":2,"of":2,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"8b73ac40-9b35-537f-aeb1-8957ba6ab4e4","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Algebra (선형식·연립·부등식)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"systems_linear","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"sl.param_no_solution.param_condition/parallel_quadratic_in_k","group":"sl.param_no_solution.param_condition","passage":"Let t be a positive constant in the system below.\n\n$tx + 5y = 2$\n$2x + (t + 3)y = 7$\n\nNo ordered pair satisfies both equations.","question":"Find t.","options":["2","3","5","-5"],"correctIndex":0,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) 해가 없으려면 두 직선이 평행(교차곱 = 0)하고 일치하지 않아야 한다. (2) 교차곱: $t(t + 3) - 5\\cdot 2 = 0$ 이다. (3) 정리하면 $t^2 + 3t - 10 = 0$ 이다. (4) 인수분해하면 (t - 2)(t + 5) = 0 이므로 t = 2 또는 t = -5 이다. (5) t 는 양수이므로 t = 2 이고 상수항이 비례하지 않아 해가 없다. 따라서 정답은 2이다.","explanationEn":"(1) No solution means parallel and distinct lines. (2) Set the cross product to zero. (3) Form the quadratic. (4) Factor. (5) Choose the positive root and check inconsistency. So the answer is 2.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T15:23:58.050Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["평행 조건이 k 에 대한 이차식이 되어 두 근 중 부호 조건에 맞는 것을 선택하고 상수항의 불일치까지 확인 — medium 은 일차 조건"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"sl.param_no_solution.param_condition","operator":"param_condition","kind":"param_no_solution","extraThinking":"평행 조건이 k 에 대한 이차식이 되어 두 근 중 부호 조건에 맞는 것을 선택하고 상수항의 불일치까지 확인 — medium 은 일차 조건","concepts":["연립방정식의 해의 개수","평행 조건(교차곱)","이차방정식의 근 선택"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":4,"seed":810000,"variant":"parallel_quadratic_in_k","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":2,"correctOption":"2"},"runId":"sat-math-harder-20261020","gid":"8b73ac40-9b35-537f-aeb1-8957ba6ab4e4","intendedSkill":"systems_linear","recipeId":"sl.param_no_solution.param_condition","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"c246895d-0c57-5add-addb-eeb9d83d6dc7","subject":"SAT Math","format":"spr","skillType":"Algebra (선형식·연립·부등식)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"systems_linear","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"sl.param_no_solution.inverse/infinitely_many_proportional","group":"sl.param_no_solution.inverse","passage":"In the system below, c and d are constants.\n\n$-5x + 4y = 9$\n$cx + 8y = d$\n\nEvery ordered pair that satisfies one equation also satisfies the other.","question":"What is the value of c + d?","options":null,"correctIndex":null,"answers":["8"],"explanation":"(1) 해가 무수히 많으면 두 식이 비례한다. (2) y 의 계수 비는 8/4 = 2 이다. (3) x 의 계수도 같은 비이므로 c = 2·(-5) = -10 이다. (4) 상수항도 같은 비이므로 d = 2·9 = 18 이다. (5) c + d = -10 + 18 = 8 이다. 따라서 정답은 8이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Infinitely many solutions mean proportional equations. (2) Find the ratio from the y-coefficients. (3) Scale the x-coefficient. (4) Scale the constant. (5) Add. So the answer is 8.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T15:23:58.050Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["해의 개수 조건에서 두 식의 비례 관계를 거꾸로 세워 두 미지 상수를 결정 — medium 은 해의 개수 판정"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"sl.param_no_solution.inverse","operator":"inverse","kind":"param_no_solution","extraThinking":"해의 개수 조건에서 두 식의 비례 관계를 거꾸로 세워 두 미지 상수를 결정 — medium 은 해의 개수 판정","concepts":["연립방정식의 해의 개수","비례 관계","미지 상수 역산"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":4,"seed":810000,"variant":"infinitely_many_proportional","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":8,"correctOption":"8"},"runId":"sat-math-harder-20261020","gid":"c246895d-0c57-5add-addb-eeb9d83d6dc7","intendedSkill":"systems_linear","recipeId":"sl.param_no_solution.inverse","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"b6d8fed9-9f8e-5b89-a2d0-af462ef54a54","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Algebra (선형식·연립·부등식)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"systems_linear","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"sl.param_no_solution.constraint_select/no_solution_vs_infinite_candidates","group":"sl.param_no_solution.constraint_select","passage":"For the system below, c is an integer from -5 to 5, inclusive. A few values make the lines parallel, which must be examined carefully.\n\n$4x + cy = -16$\n$cx + 4y = -16$","question":"What do the values of c with no solution add up to?","options":["-4","8","4","0"],"correctIndex":0,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) 평행하려면 교차곱이 0 이어야 한다: $4\\cdot 4 - c^2 = 0$ 이다. (2) c^2 = 16 이므로 c = 4 또는 c = -4 이다. (3) c = 4 에서 상수항이 비례하는지 확인한다. (4) c = -4 에서 상수항이 비례하는지 확인한다. (5) 비례하지 않는 후보만 해가 없다. 그 합은 -4 이다. 따라서 정답은 -4이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Set the cross product to zero. (2) Find the parallel candidates. (3) Check the constants for the positive candidate. (4) Check the constants for the negative candidate. (5) Sum the candidates with no solution. So the answer is -4.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T15:23:58.050Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["평행한 두 후보 k 에서 상수항 비례 여부를 따로 확인해 '해 없음'과 '무수히 많음'을 구분하고 해당하는 k 만 선택 — medium 은 일차 조건"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"sl.param_no_solution.constraint_select","operator":"constraint_select","kind":"param_no_solution","extraThinking":"평행한 두 후보 k 에서 상수항 비례 여부를 따로 확인해 '해 없음'과 '무수히 많음'을 구분하고 해당하는 k 만 선택 — medium 은 일차 조건","concepts":["연립방정식의 해의 개수","평행 조건","해 없음과 무한해의 구분"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":4,"seed":810000,"variant":"no_solution_vs_infinite_candidates","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":-4,"correctOption":"-4"},"runId":"sat-math-harder-20261020","gid":"b6d8fed9-9f8e-5b89-a2d0-af462ef54a54","intendedSkill":"systems_linear","recipeId":"sl.param_no_solution.constraint_select","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"18ffd441-104b-53a4-a54f-747e5477406f","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Algebra (선형식·연립·부등식)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"systems_linear","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"sl.param_no_solution.compose_kind/parallel_then_point_constant","group":"sl.param_no_solution.compose_kind","passage":"In the system below, k and c are constants.\n\n$y = x + 4$\n$kx + 2y = c$\n\nThe system has no solution. The point $(5, 6)$ lies on the graph of the second equation.","question":"What is the value of c?","options":["21","22","-2","2"],"correctIndex":3,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) 첫 식의 기울기는 1 이다. (2) 해가 없으면 기울기가 같다: -k/2 = 1 이다. (3) k = -2 이다. (4) 점 (5, 6) 를 둘째 식에 대입하면 c = -2·5 + 2·6 이다. (5) c = 2 이다(절편이 달라 해가 없다). 따라서 정답은 2이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Read the first slope. (2) Equal slopes give no solution. (3) Solve for the first constant. (4) Substitute the point. (5) Compute the constant. So the answer is 2.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T15:23:58.050Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["해가 없다는 조건(평행)과 직선이 지나는 점 조건을 합성해 두 미지 상수를 차례로 결정 — medium 은 일차 조건"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"sl.param_no_solution.compose_kind","operator":"compose_kind","kind":"param_no_solution","extraThinking":"해가 없다는 조건(평행)과 직선이 지나는 점 조건을 합성해 두 미지 상수를 차례로 결정 — medium 은 일차 조건","concepts":["연립방정식의 해의 개수(평행)","점 대입","미지 상수 결정"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":4,"seed":810000,"variant":"parallel_then_point_constant","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":2,"correctOption":"2"},"runId":"sat-math-harder-20261020","gid":"18ffd441-104b-53a4-a54f-747e5477406f","intendedSkill":"systems_linear","recipeId":"sl.param_no_solution.compose_kind","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"9707ee15-1d69-5b06-a37b-a9732a976c9a","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Algebra (선형식·연립·부등식)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"systems_linear","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"sl.word_system.repr_shift/relation_and_revenue","group":"sl.word_system.repr_shift","passage":"At a charity sale, every sale was a hardcover book or a paperback book. The number of paperback books sold was 5 less than four times the number of hardcover books sold. Hardcover books are sold at 11 dollars each and paperback books at 5 dollars each; the revenue came to 626 dollars.","question":"What is the number of paperback books sold?","options":["79","125","21","19"],"correctIndex":0,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) hardcover book 수를 x, paperback book 수를 y 라 한다. (2) '5 less than four times the number' 는 $y = 4x - 5$ 이다. (3) 금액 식: $11x + 5y = 626$ 이다. (4) 대입하면 $11x + 5(4x - 5) = 626$ 이므로 $31x = 651$ 이다. (5) x = 21, y = 4·21 - 5 = 79 이다. 따라서 정답은 79이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Define the variables. (2) Translate the relation. (3) Write the revenue equation. (4) Substitute and collect. (5) Solve and find the other count. So the answer is 79.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T15:23:58.051Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["문장 관계(m 배보다 k 적음)와 금액 조건을 두 식으로 번역하고 대입하는 모델링 — medium 은 총 개수와 총 수입이 직접 주어진 연립"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"sl.word_system.repr_shift","operator":"repr_shift","kind":"word_system","extraThinking":"문장 관계(m 배보다 k 적음)와 금액 조건을 두 식으로 번역하고 대입하는 모델링 — medium 은 총 개수와 총 수입이 직접 주어진 연립","concepts":["문장→연립방정식","대입법","금액 식 세우기"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":4,"seed":810000,"variant":"relation_and_revenue","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":79,"correctOption":"79"},"runId":"sat-math-harder-20261020","gid":"9707ee15-1d69-5b06-a37b-a9732a976c9a","intendedSkill":"systems_linear","recipeId":"sl.word_system.repr_shift","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"75d75ab8-c753-5fa9-a958-a633c5dc6aa6","subject":"SAT Math","format":"spr","skillType":"Algebra (선형식·연립·부등식)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"systems_linear","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"sl.word_system.unit_ratio/mixture_concentration","group":"sl.word_system.unit_ratio","passage":"A caterer combines some 10% juice drink and some 30% juice drink, and the result is 30 liters of 22% juice drink. Assume that no juice is lost when the liquids are combined.","question":"How much of the 30% juice drink, in liters, must be used?","options":null,"correctIndex":null,"answers":["18"],"explanation":"(1) 약한 용액 x 리터, 강한 용액 y 리터라 하면 $x + y = 30$ 이다. (2) 용질 양을 소수 비율로 쓰면 $0.1x + 0.3y = 0.22\\cdot 30$ 이다. (3) 양변에 100 을 곱하면 $10x + 30y = 660$ 이다. (4) 첫 식에 10 을 곱해 빼면 $20y = 360$ 이다. (5) y = 18 이다. 따라서 정답은 18이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Write the volume equation. (2) Write the solute equation with decimal percents. (3) Clear the decimals. (4) Eliminate x. (5) Solve. So the answer is 18.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T15:23:58.051Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["퍼센트 농도를 소수/비율로 바꿔 용질량 식을 세우고 부피 합 식과 연립 — medium 은 식이 주어진 연립"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"sl.word_system.unit_ratio","operator":"unit_ratio","kind":"word_system","extraThinking":"퍼센트 농도를 소수/비율로 바꿔 용질량 식을 세우고 부피 합 식과 연립 — medium 은 식이 주어진 연립","concepts":["퍼센트 농도(비율)","문장→연립방정식","소거법"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":4,"seed":810000,"variant":"mixture_concentration","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":18,"correctOption":"18"},"runId":"sat-math-harder-20261020","gid":"75d75ab8-c753-5fa9-a958-a633c5dc6aa6","intendedSkill":"systems_linear","recipeId":"sl.word_system.unit_ratio","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"8966d9e3-f71b-5c42-af59-85a1f9e92690","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Algebra (선형식·연립·부등식)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"systems_linear","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"sl.word_system.compare_scenarios/common_cost_at_crossover","group":"sl.word_system.compare_scenarios","passage":"At a tutoring center, Plan A costs 16 dollars per session plus a registration fee of 30 dollars. Plan B costs 8 dollars for each session plus a registration fee of 118 dollars.","question":"For the number of sessions at which the two plans cost the same, what is that common cost, in dollars?","options":["206","118","11","74"],"correctIndex":0,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) Plan A 의 비용은 $16n + 30$ 이다. (2) Plan B 의 비용은 $8n + 118$ 이다. (3) 같아지면 $16n + 30 = 8n + 118$ 이다. (4) $8n = 88$ 이므로 n = 11 이다. (5) 그때의 비용은 16·11 + 30 = 206 이다. 따라서 정답은 206이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Model Plan A. (2) Model Plan B. (3) Set the costs equal. (4) Solve for n. (5) Find the common cost. So the answer is 206.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T15:23:58.051Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["두 상황을 식으로 세워 같아지는 시점을 구한 뒤 다시 그 시점의 값을 계산(묻는 것이 해의 x 가 아닌 y) — medium 은 식이 주어진 연립"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"sl.word_system.compare_scenarios","operator":"compare_scenarios","kind":"word_system","extraThinking":"두 상황을 식으로 세워 같아지는 시점을 구한 뒤 다시 그 시점의 값을 계산(묻는 것이 해의 x 가 아닌 y) — medium 은 식이 주어진 연립","concepts":["문장→연립방정식","교점의 의미","대입으로 비용 계산"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":4,"seed":810000,"variant":"common_cost_at_crossover","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":206,"correctOption":"206"},"runId":"sat-math-harder-20261020","gid":"8966d9e3-f71b-5c42-af59-85a1f9e92690","intendedSkill":"systems_linear","recipeId":"sl.word_system.compare_scenarios","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"72ef7543-1806-5a93-a4ac-8208c4f6ae4e","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Algebra (선형식·연립·부등식)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"systems_linear","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"sl.word_system.chain2/prices_then_new_order","group":"sl.word_system.chain2","passage":"A teacher buys apples and pears at fixed prices. The first purchase, 5 apples and 5 pears, costs 35 dollars. 6 apples and 5 pears together cost 39 dollars.","question":"Using the same prices, what is the total cost, in dollars, of 8 apples and 6 pears?","options":["50","48","32","74"],"correctIndex":0,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) apple 값을 x, pear 값을 y 라 하면 $5x + 5y = 35$ 이다. (2) 둘째 주문: $6x + 5y = 39$ 이다. (3) 한 변수의 계수를 맞춰 빼서 소거한다. (4) x = 4, y = 3 를 얻는다. (5) 새 주문: 8·4 + 6·3 = 50 이다. 따라서 정답은 50이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Write the first order. (2) Write the second order. (3) Eliminate one variable. (4) Find both prices. (5) Compute the new order. So the answer is 50.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T15:23:58.052Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["연립으로 단가를 먼저 구한 뒤 그 결과를 새 주문 계산의 입력으로 쓰는 2단계 연쇄 — medium 은 단가 하나를 구함"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"sl.word_system.chain2","operator":"chain2","kind":"word_system","extraThinking":"연립으로 단가를 먼저 구한 뒤 그 결과를 새 주문 계산의 입력으로 쓰는 2단계 연쇄 — medium 은 단가 하나를 구함","concepts":["문장→연립방정식","소거법","구한 단가의 재사용"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":4,"seed":810000,"variant":"prices_then_new_order","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":50,"correctOption":"50"},"runId":"sat-math-harder-20261020","gid":"72ef7543-1806-5a93-a4ac-8208c4f6ae4e","intendedSkill":"systems_linear","recipeId":"sl.word_system.chain2","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"e2ea1986-f195-5d08-a88c-62ff5718de0f","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Algebra (선형식·연립·부등식)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"systems_linear","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"slb.system_applications.inverse/age_multiple_now_and_later","group":"slb.system_applications.inverse","passage":"The next few lines describe a scenario used in a study session. Coach Reyes is 4 times as old as his nephew. In 9 years, the older person will be 3 times as old as his nephew will be then. Everything described here happened within a single ordinary week.","question":"How old is the older person now?","options":["18","108","72","81"],"correctIndex":2,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) 어린 사람의 나이를 s 라 하면 어른은 4s 이다. (2) 9 년 뒤 어른은 4s + 9, 어린 사람은 s + 9 이다. (3) 4s + 9 = 3(s + 9) 이다. (4) 1s = 18 이므로 s = 18 이다. (5) 어른의 나이는 4 × 18 = 72 이다. 따라서 정답은 72이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Name the ages. (2) Ages in the future. (3) Set up the second equation. (4) Solve for s. (5) Older person's age. So the answer is 72.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T15:23:58.052Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["서로 다른 형태의 조건(자리 뒤집기, 시점이 다른 배수, 비와 일차식)을 연립으로 번역해야 함 — medium 은 식이 주어진 연립 풀이"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"slb.system_applications.inverse","operator":"inverse","kind":"system_applications","extraThinking":"서로 다른 형태의 조건(자리 뒤집기, 시점이 다른 배수, 비와 일차식)을 연립으로 번역해야 함 — medium 은 식이 주어진 연립 풀이","concepts":["연립방정식 세우기","조건 번역","소거·대입"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":3,"seed":810000,"variant":"age_multiple_now_and_later","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":72,"correctOption":"72"},"runId":"sat-math-harder-20261020","gid":"e2ea1986-f195-5d08-a88c-62ff5718de0f","intendedSkill":"systems_linear","recipeId":"slb.system_applications.inverse","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"952d4b93-4231-5f98-aa1c-18a95c34c5e7","subject":"SAT Math","format":"spr","skillType":"Algebra (선형식·연립·부등식)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"systems_linear","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"slb.system_applications.compose_kind/wind_two_legs_airspeed","group":"slb.system_applications.compose_kind","passage":"Here are the details of a realistic scenario for practice. A small plane flies 354 miles with a tailwind in 2 hours. On another leg, it flies 665 miles directly against the same constant wind in 5 hours. The plane's airspeed and the wind speed are both constant. The facts above were reported by a reliable witness.","question":"What is the airspeed of the plane, in miles per hour?","options":null,"correctIndex":null,"answers":["155"],"explanation":"(1) 비행기 속력을 s, 바람 속력을 w 라 하면 순풍은 s + w, 맞바람은 s − w 이다. (2) 354 ÷ 2 = 177 이므로 s + w = 177 이다. (3) 665 ÷ 5 = 133 이므로 s − w = 133 이다. (4) 두 식을 더하면 2s = 310 이다. (5) s = 155 mph 이다. 따라서 정답은 155이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Speeds with and against the wind. (2) Tailwind leg. (3) Headwind leg. (4) Add the equations. (5) Airspeed. So the answer is 155.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T15:23:58.052Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["연립 풀이를 다른 개념(기하·평균·이자)의 계산에 합성해야 함 — medium 은 연립방정식 자체의 풀이"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"slb.system_applications.compose_kind","operator":"compose_kind","kind":"system_applications","extraThinking":"연립 풀이를 다른 개념(기하·평균·이자)의 계산에 합성해야 함 — medium 은 연립방정식 자체의 풀이","concepts":["연립방정식","기하·평균·속도·이자 개념","식 합성"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":3,"seed":810000,"variant":"wind_two_legs_airspeed","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":155,"correctOption":"155"},"runId":"sat-math-harder-20261020","gid":"952d4b93-4231-5f98-aa1c-18a95c34c5e7","intendedSkill":"systems_linear","recipeId":"slb.system_applications.compose_kind","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"6be6e224-fb1d-56cc-aaa4-4c4160ee8403","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Algebra (선형식·연립·부등식)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"systems_linear","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"slb.system_applications.chain2/resource_two_machines_units","group":"slb.system_applications.chain2","passage":"This situation is taken from a workbook of review exercises. A workshop makes backpacks and tote bags. Each of the backpacks needs 4 hours on the cutting machine and 2 hours on the welding machine. Each of the tote bags needs 1 hours on the cutting machine and 1 hours on the welding machine. This week the cutting machine runs exactly 93 hours and the welding machine runs exactly 49 hours. None of the details were altered after they were first recorded.","question":"What is the number of backpacks produced?","options":["23","22","27","5"],"correctIndex":1,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) backpacks 를 x 대, tote bags 를 y 대 만든다고 하자. (2) 절단 기계: 4x + 1y = 93 이다. (3) 용접 기계: 2x + 1y = 49 이다. (4) 한 문자를 소거하도록 두 식에 적당한 수를 곱해 뺀다. (5) x = 22, y = 5 이므로 backpacks 는 22 대이다. 따라서 정답은 22이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Name the unknowns. (2) Cutting-machine equation. (3) Welding-machine equation. (4) Eliminate one variable. (5) Solve. So the answer is 22.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T15:23:58.052Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["연립을 풀어 얻은 값에서 다시 묻는 양을 계산하는 연쇄 — medium 은 연립 풀이 한 번"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"slb.system_applications.chain2","operator":"chain2","kind":"system_applications","extraThinking":"연립을 풀어 얻은 값에서 다시 묻는 양을 계산하는 연쇄 — medium 은 연립 풀이 한 번","concepts":["연립 풀이","연쇄 계산","문장 모델링"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":3,"seed":810000,"variant":"resource_two_machines_units","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":22,"correctOption":"22"},"runId":"sat-math-harder-20261020","gid":"6be6e224-fb1d-56cc-aaa4-4c4160ee8403","intendedSkill":"systems_linear","recipeId":"slb.system_applications.chain2","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"e60bc325-4980-5c24-aa20-a6ddc9928e57","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Algebra (선형식·연립·부등식)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"systems_linear","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"slb.system_applications.param_condition/integer_solution_k_count","group":"slb.system_applications.param_condition","passage":"A review handout presents the situation described below. Consider the system $kx + y = 60$ and $x - y = 0$, where k is a positive integer. Every number given here is exact and comes from the official records.","question":"How many values of k, with k a positive integer no greater than 11, make x an integer?","options":["7","11","6","8"],"correctIndex":0,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) 두 식을 더하면 y 가 소거된다: (k + 1)x = 60 이다. (2) x = 60/(k + 1) 이다. (3) x 가 정수이려면 k + 1 이 60 의 약수여야 한다. (4) 2 ≤ k + 1 ≤ 12 인 약수를 센다. (5) 7 개이다. 따라서 정답은 7이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Add the equations to eliminate y. (2) Solve for x. (3) k + 1 must divide the constant. (4) Count divisors in the allowed range. (5) Count. So the answer is 7.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T15:23:58.052Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["계수 비교·소거의 구조를 읽어 매개변수 조건을 따져야 함 — medium 은 매개변수를 알고 해를 구함"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"slb.system_applications.param_condition","operator":"param_condition","kind":"system_applications","extraThinking":"계수 비교·소거의 구조를 읽어 매개변수 조건을 따져야 함 — medium 은 매개변수를 알고 해를 구함","concepts":["연립방정식","계수 조건","정수·유일해 조건"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":3,"seed":810000,"variant":"integer_solution_k_count","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":7,"correctOption":"7"},"runId":"sat-math-harder-20261020","gid":"e60bc325-4980-5c24-aa20-a6ddc9928e57","intendedSkill":"systems_linear","recipeId":"slb.system_applications.param_condition","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"29e24b29-1105-57c3-a1df-bd4f1c6b377f","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Algebra (선형식·연립·부등식)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"systems_linear","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"sl.substitution_solve.inverse/unknown_constant_by_substitution","group":"sl.substitution_solve.inverse","passage":"Let k be a constant in the system below. One coordinate of the solution is known: $x = 1$.\n\n$y = -x - 6$\n$kx - 2y = 16$","question":"What is the value of k?","options":["30","2","-2","18"],"correctIndex":1,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) 첫 식에 x = 1 를 대입하면 y = -1·1 + (-6) = -7 이다. (2) 해는 (1, -7) 이다. (3) 둘째 식에 대입하면 k·1 + (-2)·(-7) = 16 이다. (4) -2·(-7) = 14 를 이항하면 k·1 = 2 이다. (5) k = 2/1 = 2 이다. 따라서 정답은 2이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Substitute x into the first equation. (2) State the solution. (3) Substitute into the second equation. (4) Isolate the constant's term. (5) Solve. So the answer is 2.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T15:23:58.052Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["해의 일부(x 좌표)에서 대입으로 나머지를 복원한 뒤 미지 계수를 결정하는 역방향 — medium 은 두 식이 모두 주어진 대입법"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"sl.substitution_solve.inverse","operator":"inverse","kind":"substitution_solve","extraThinking":"해의 일부(x 좌표)에서 대입으로 나머지를 복원한 뒤 미지 계수를 결정하는 역방향 — medium 은 두 식이 모두 주어진 대입법","concepts":["대입법","해의 의미","미지 상수 역산"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":4,"seed":810001,"variant":"unknown_constant_by_substitution","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":2,"correctOption":"2"},"runId":"sat-math-harder-20261020","gid":"29e24b29-1105-57c3-a1df-bd4f1c6b377f","intendedSkill":"systems_linear","recipeId":"sl.substitution_solve.inverse","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"cecfd366-6776-59ea-ab63-59609bf9f262","subject":"SAT Math","format":"spr","skillType":"Algebra (선형식·연립·부등식)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"systems_linear","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"sl.substitution_solve.compose_kind/length_width_perimeter_area","group":"sl.substitution_solve.compose_kind","passage":"The length of a rectangular courtyard is x yards, and its width is y yards. The length is 4 yards more than the width. The perimeter is 36 yards.","question":"Find the area of the courtyard in square yards.","options":null,"correctIndex":null,"answers":["77"],"explanation":"(1) 연립식: $x = y + 4$ 와 $2x + 2y = 36$ 이다. (2) 첫 식을 둘째 식에 대입하면 $2(y + 4) + 2y = 36$ 이다. (3) 정리하면 $4y + 8 = 36$ 이므로 y = 7 이다. (4) x = 7 + 4 = 11 이다. (5) 넓이는 11 × 7 = 77 이다. 따라서 정답은 77이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Write the system. (2) Substitute. (3) Solve for y. (4) Find x. (5) Multiply. So the answer is 77.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T15:23:58.052Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["문장 조건을 연립으로 세워 대입으로 풀고 기하 공식(넓이)과 합성 — medium 은 두 식이 주어진 연립에서 한 값을 구함"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"sl.substitution_solve.compose_kind","operator":"compose_kind","kind":"substitution_solve","extraThinking":"문장 조건을 연립으로 세워 대입으로 풀고 기하 공식(넓이)과 합성 — medium 은 두 식이 주어진 연립에서 한 값을 구함","concepts":["대입법","직사각형 둘레","직사각형 넓이"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":4,"seed":810001,"variant":"length_width_perimeter_area","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":77,"correctOption":"77"},"runId":"sat-math-harder-20261020","gid":"cecfd366-6776-59ea-ab63-59609bf9f262","intendedSkill":"systems_linear","recipeId":"sl.substitution_solve.compose_kind","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"7177707f-c3de-5730-a08d-3ec906002a24","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Algebra (선형식·연립·부등식)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"systems_linear","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"sl.substitution_solve.repr_shift/sum_and_multiple_relation","group":"sl.substitution_solve.repr_shift","passage":"A pair of numbers has a sum of 49. One number exceeds twice the other by 4.","question":"What is the value of the larger of the two numbers?","options":["45","30","34","15"],"correctIndex":2,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) 작은 수를 x, 큰 수를 y 라 하면 $x + y = 49$ 이다. (2) '4 more than twice the lesser' 는 $y = 2x + 4$ 이다. (3) 대입하면 $x + 2x + 4 = 49$ 이다. (4) $3x = 45$ 이므로 x = 15 이다. (5) y = 2·15 + 4 = 34 이다. 따라서 정답은 34이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Define the variables and the sum equation. (2) Translate the relation. (3) Substitute. (4) Solve for x. (5) Find the larger number. So the answer is 34.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T15:23:58.052Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["문장 관계(m 배보다 k 큼)를 식으로 정확히 번역한 뒤 대입 — medium 은 식이 주어진 대입법"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"sl.substitution_solve.repr_shift","operator":"repr_shift","kind":"substitution_solve","extraThinking":"문장 관계(m 배보다 k 큼)를 식으로 정확히 번역한 뒤 대입 — medium 은 식이 주어진 대입법","concepts":["문장→연립방정식","대입법"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":4,"seed":810001,"variant":"sum_and_multiple_relation","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":34,"correctOption":"34"},"runId":"sat-math-harder-20261020","gid":"7177707f-c3de-5730-a08d-3ec906002a24","intendedSkill":"systems_linear","recipeId":"sl.substitution_solve.repr_shift","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":2,"minMet":2,"of":2,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"7e77a44c-9050-5a1a-a1ac-439e9f791c32","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Algebra (선형식·연립·부등식)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"systems_linear","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"sl.substitution_solve.chain2/three_variable_chain","group":"sl.substitution_solve.chain2","passage":"Three numbers p, q, and r are related by the three equations below.\n\n$r = 4q$\n$q = p + 3$\n$p + q + r = 57$","question":"What is the value of r?","options":["7","40","28","10"],"correctIndex":1,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) 둘째 식의 q = p + 3 를 r = 4q 에 대입하면 r = 4(p + 3) = 4p + 12 이다. (2) 합의 식에 q 와 r 를 모두 p 로 바꾼다: p + (p + 3) + (4p + 12) = 57. (3) 정리하면 $6p + 15 = 57$ 이다. (4) p = 7 이다. (5) q = 10, r = 4·10 = 40 이다. 따라서 정답은 40이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Substitute into the third equation. (2) Substitute both into the sum equation. (3) Combine like terms. (4) Solve for the first variable. (5) Back-substitute. So the answer is 40.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T15:23:58.053Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["한 변수를 다른 변수로 연쇄적으로 바꿔 넣는 다단계 대입(세 변수) — medium 은 두 변수 대입법"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"sl.substitution_solve.chain2","operator":"chain2","kind":"substitution_solve","extraThinking":"한 변수를 다른 변수로 연쇄적으로 바꿔 넣는 다단계 대입(세 변수) — medium 은 두 변수 대입법","concepts":["대입법","연쇄 대입","세 변수 연립"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":4,"seed":810001,"variant":"three_variable_chain","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":40,"correctOption":"40"},"runId":"sat-math-harder-20261020","gid":"7e77a44c-9050-5a1a-a1ac-439e9f791c32","intendedSkill":"systems_linear","recipeId":"sl.substitution_solve.chain2","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"65a857e4-2159-58bd-a51d-e7603446ea8c","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nes.root.param_condition/ask_solution","group":"nes.root.param_condition","passage":"Last week, a teaching assistant is working through a homework item for a math contest and wants to see a clean solution. In the equation given here, k is a positive constant, and the equation has a single real solution.\n\n$x^2 + kx + 100 = 0$","question":"What is the value of x that satisfies the equation?","options":["-20","10","20","-10"],"correctIndex":3,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) 해가 하나뿐이므로 방정식은 중근을 갖고, 판별식 D = 0 이다. (2) D = k² - 4·100 = 0 이므로 k² = 400 이다. (3) k 는 양수이므로 k = 20 이다. (4) 방정식은 $(x + 10)^2 = 0$ 꼴이다. (5) 따라서 해는 x = -10 이다. 따라서 정답은 -10이다.","explanationEn":"(1) One solution means a double root, so D = 0. (2) Write the discriminant condition. (3) Choose the positive constant. (4) The equation becomes a perfect square. (5) Read off the solution. So the answer is -10.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T15:23:58.053Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["해의 개수 조건을 판별식 식으로 번역하고 부호 조건(양수 상수)으로 값을 하나로 고른 뒤 다시 방정식을 풀어야 한다 — medium 은 인수분해된 두 근 중 큰 근을 읽는 풀이"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nes.root.param_condition","operator":"param_condition","kind":"root","extraThinking":"해의 개수 조건을 판별식 식으로 번역하고 부호 조건(양수 상수)으로 값을 하나로 고른 뒤 다시 방정식을 풀어야 한다 — medium 은 인수분해된 두 근 중 큰 근을 읽는 풀이","concepts":["판별식 조건","완전제곱 중근","부호 조건 선택"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":2,"seed":810000,"variant":"ask_solution","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":-10,"correctOption":"-10"},"runId":"sat-math-harder-20261020","gid":"65a857e4-2159-58bd-a51d-e7603446ea8c","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","recipeId":"nes.root.param_condition","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"d233df9d-18fe-5dda-ad3b-a389a707809a","subject":"SAT Math","format":"spr","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nes.root.constraint_select/radical_equation","group":"nes.root.constraint_select","passage":"In a practice session, a textbook author is grading an old test item before an exam and wants to see a clean solution. For the equation shown, x is a real number. $\\sqrt{x + 1} = x - 5$","question":"Which value of x satisfies the equation?","options":null,"correctIndex":null,"answers":["8"],"explanation":"(1) 양변을 제곱해 근호를 없앤다. (2) $x + 1 = (x - 5)^2$ 를 전개해 표준형으로 정리한다. (3) $x^2 - 11x + 24 = 0$ 이다. (4) 인수분해하면 x = 3 또는 x = 8 이다. (5) 원식의 우변 $x - 5$ 은 근호 값이므로 0 이상이어야 한다. x = 3 일 때 -2 < 0 이라 제외한다. (6) x = 8 를 원식에 대입해 성립함을 확인한다. 따라서 정답은 8이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Square both sides to remove the radical. (2) Expand and move everything to one side. (3) Write the quadratic. (4) Factor to get two candidates. (5) The right side must be nonnegative, which rules out one candidate. (6) Verify the remaining candidate. So the answer is 8.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T15:23:58.054Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["제곱으로 생긴 외래근을 원식에 대입해 걸러내야 한다(제약 추적·후보 제거) — medium 은 인수분해로 나온 근을 그대로 답"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nes.root.constraint_select","operator":"constraint_select","kind":"root","extraThinking":"제곱으로 생긴 외래근을 원식에 대입해 걸러내야 한다(제약 추적·후보 제거) — medium 은 인수분해로 나온 근을 그대로 답","concepts":["무리방정식 제곱","이차방정식 인수분해","외래근 검증"],"steps":6,"mediumSteps":2,"seed":810000,"variant":"radical_equation","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":8,"correctOption":"8"},"runId":"sat-math-harder-20261020","gid":"d233df9d-18fe-5dda-ad3b-a389a707809a","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","recipeId":"nes.root.constraint_select","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"ca330751-046a-5b1f-a4c5-314fc9a5a0b0","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nes.root.chain2/smaller","group":"nes.root.chain2","passage":"Last week, a teaching assistant is working through a homework item during a study session and wants to see a clean solution. Let k be the larger solution of the equation $x^2 - 3x - 4 = 0$. Now consider a second equation, written with k:\n\n$x^2 - 2kx + k^2 - 49 = 0$","question":"What is the lesser solution of the second equation?","options":["-3","11","4","7"],"correctIndex":0,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) 첫 방정식 $x^2 - 3x - 4 = 0$ 을 인수분해한다. (2) 근은 x = -1 과 x = 4 이므로 큰 근 k = 4 이다. (3) 둘째 방정식에 k = 4 를 대입한다: $(x - 4)^2 = 49$ 꼴이다. (4) 양변의 제곱근을 취하면 x - 4 = ±7 이다. (5) x = -3 또는 x = 11 이다. (6) 작은 근은 -3 이다. 따라서 정답은 -3이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Factor the first equation. (2) Find the two solutions and take the larger one as k. (3) Substitute k. (4) Take square roots. (5) Solve for x. (6) Choose the requested solution. So the answer is -3.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T15:23:58.054Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["앞 단계에서 구한 값이 뒤 방정식의 계수가 되는 2단계 연쇄 — medium 은 한 방정식의 근 하나"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nes.root.chain2","operator":"chain2","kind":"root","extraThinking":"앞 단계에서 구한 값이 뒤 방정식의 계수가 되는 2단계 연쇄 — medium 은 한 방정식의 근 하나","concepts":["이차방정식 인수분해","치환·전개","완전제곱형 방정식"],"steps":6,"mediumSteps":2,"seed":810000,"variant":"smaller","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":-3,"correctOption":"-3"},"runId":"sat-math-harder-20261020","gid":"ca330751-046a-5b1f-a4c5-314fc9a5a0b0","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","recipeId":"nes.root.chain2","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"1ab72107-cc5e-569e-a122-d55217d047bf","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nes.root.inverse/sum_coeffs","group":"nes.root.inverse","passage":"As part of a unit review, a tutor is reviewing an old test item with a partner and wants to double-check the result. In the equation below, p and q are constants. One solution of the equation is -3, and the other solution is 1 more than that solution.\n\n$x^2 + px + q = 0$","question":"Find p + q.","options":["11","1","6","5"],"correctIndex":0,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) 한 근이 -3 이고 다른 근은 1 more than 이므로 다른 근은 -2 이다. (2) 근의 합은 -3 + (-2) = -5 이고 이것은 -p 와 같다. (3) 따라서 p = 5 이다. (4) 근의 곱은 -3·(-2) = 6 이고 이것은 q 와 같다. (5) p + q = 5 + 6 = 11 이다. 따라서 정답은 11이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Find the other solution. (2) The sum of the solutions equals the negative of the linear coefficient. (3) Solve for the linear coefficient. (4) The product equals the constant term. (5) Compute the requested combination. So the answer is 11.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T15:23:58.054Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["근 → 계수의 역방향 재구성(두 번째 근 도출, 합·곱의 부호 처리) — medium 은 주어진 방정식의 근을 읽음"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nes.root.inverse","operator":"inverse","kind":"root","extraThinking":"근 → 계수의 역방향 재구성(두 번째 근 도출, 합·곱의 부호 처리) — medium 은 주어진 방정식의 근을 읽음","concepts":["근과 계수의 관계","근의 차 조건","계수 역산"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":2,"seed":810000,"variant":"sum_coeffs","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":11,"correctOption":"11"},"runId":"sat-math-harder-20261020","gid":"1ab72107-cc5e-569e-a122-d55217d047bf","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","recipeId":"nes.root.inverse","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"79ea2cfd-1e6d-53cf-a580-72303096491c","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nes.sum_of_roots.inverse/rearranged_form","group":"nes.sum_of_roots.inverse","passage":"At the start of class, a study group is preparing a warm-up question for the class and wants to double-check the result. Consider the equation below, which has two real solutions, where b and c are constants. The sum of the solutions is -2, and the product of the solutions is -24.\n\n$3x^2 = bx + c$","question":"What is the value of b + c?","options":["-6","66","72","-78"],"correctIndex":1,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) 3x² = bx + c 를 표준형으로 이항하면 $3x^2 - bx - c = 0$ 이다. (2) 두 근의 합 = b/3 = -2 이므로 b = -6 이다. (3) 두 근의 곱 = -c/3 = -24 이므로 c = 72 이다. (4) 부호에 주의해 b 와 c 를 확인한다(c 는 이항 때문에 곱의 -3 배). (5) b + c = -6 + 72 = 66 이다. 따라서 정답은 66이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Move every term to one side. (2) Use the sum of solutions. (3) Use the product of solutions. (4) Check the signs created by moving terms. (5) Add. So the answer is 66.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T15:23:58.054Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["표준형으로 이항할 때 b·c 의 부호 변화를 추적하며 합·곱 조건을 계수로 역산 — medium 은 표준형 방정식의 근의 합을 -b/a 로 읽음"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nes.sum_of_roots.inverse","operator":"inverse","kind":"sum_of_roots","extraThinking":"표준형으로 이항할 때 b·c 의 부호 변화를 추적하며 합·곱 조건을 계수로 역산 — medium 은 표준형 방정식의 근의 합을 -b/a 로 읽음","concepts":["표준형 정리(이항)","근과 계수의 관계","계수 역산"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":2,"seed":810000,"variant":"rearranged_form","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":66,"correctOption":"66"},"runId":"sat-math-harder-20261020","gid":"79ea2cfd-1e6d-53cf-a580-72303096491c","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","recipeId":"nes.sum_of_roots.inverse","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"8475e1a8-8e5a-5b8f-ac36-3c0f6f76f974","subject":"SAT Math","format":"spr","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nes.sum_of_roots.param_condition/param_sum_condition","group":"nes.sum_of_roots.param_condition","passage":"Today, a tutor is checking a warm-up question at the whiteboard and wonders which method is fastest. In the given equation, k is a constant. The equation has two real solutions, and the sum of the solutions is -3.\n\n$x^2 + (-2k + 7)x + (3k - 24) = 0$","question":"Find the product of the two solutions.","options":null,"correctIndex":null,"answers":["-18"],"explanation":"(1) 이차항의 계수가 1 이므로 두 근의 합은 x 의 계수의 부호를 바꾼 값이다. (2) -(-2k + 7) = -3 로 놓는다. (3) 이 일차방정식을 풀면 k = 2 이다. (4) 상수항에 k = 2 를 대입하면 3·2 + (-24) = -18 이다. (5) 두 근의 곱은 상수항과 같으므로 -18 이다. 따라서 정답은 -18이다.","explanationEn":"(1) The sum of solutions is the negative of the linear coefficient. (2) Set the sum equal to the given value. (3) Solve for k. (4) Substitute k into the constant term. (5) The product equals the constant term. So the answer is -18.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T15:23:58.054Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["근의 합 조건을 매개변수 방정식으로 번역해 k 를 정한 뒤 다른 계수에 다시 대입 — medium 은 계수가 숫자인 방정식에서 합을 읽음"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nes.sum_of_roots.param_condition","operator":"param_condition","kind":"sum_of_roots","extraThinking":"근의 합 조건을 매개변수 방정식으로 번역해 k 를 정한 뒤 다른 계수에 다시 대입 — medium 은 계수가 숫자인 방정식에서 합을 읽음","concepts":["근과 계수의 관계","매개변수 일차방정식","대입 후 곱 계산"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":2,"seed":810000,"variant":"param_sum_condition","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":-18,"correctOption":"-18"},"runId":"sat-math-harder-20261020","gid":"8475e1a8-8e5a-5b8f-ac36-3c0f6f76f974","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","recipeId":"nes.sum_of_roots.param_condition","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"1d770f85-3757-59a4-a127-e286f42df62e","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nes.sum_of_roots.compose_kind/sum_of_x","group":"nes.sum_of_roots.compose_kind","passage":"For extra practice, a textbook author is writing up a review exercise during a study session and wants to double-check the result. The system of equations below graphs a parabola and a line that meet at two points in the xy-plane.\n\n$y = x^2 + 4x + 3$\n$y = 2x + 18$","question":"What is the sum of the x-coordinates of the two points of intersection?","options":["-15","2","6","-2"],"correctIndex":3,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) 교점에서는 두 식의 y 가 같으므로 두 식의 우변을 같게 놓는다. (2) $x^2 + 4x + 3 = 2x + 18$ 이다. (3) 모두 한쪽으로 옮기면 $x^2 + 2x - 15 = 0$ 이다. (4) 두 근의 합은 -(2) = -2 = -2 이다 (x 좌표의 합). (5) 두 교점이 서로 다른 실수임을 판별식으로 확인한다. 따라서 정답은 -2이다.","explanationEn":"(1) At an intersection the two y-values are equal. (2) Set the right sides equal. (3) Move all terms to one side. (4) The sum of solutions is the negative of the linear coefficient. (5) Check that two distinct intersections exist. So the answer is -2.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T15:23:58.055Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["연립(교점) 개념과 근의 합 개념을 연결해 두 식을 같게 놓고 정리한 뒤 합을 읽는다 — medium 은 주어진 이차방정식의 근의 합"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nes.sum_of_roots.compose_kind","operator":"compose_kind","kind":"sum_of_roots","extraThinking":"연립(교점) 개념과 근의 합 개념을 연결해 두 식을 같게 놓고 정리한 뒤 합을 읽는다 — medium 은 주어진 이차방정식의 근의 합","concepts":["이차함수와 직선의 교점","방정식 정리","근과 계수의 관계"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":2,"seed":810000,"variant":"sum_of_x","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":-2,"correctOption":"-2"},"runId":"sat-math-harder-20261020","gid":"1d770f85-3757-59a4-a127-e286f42df62e","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","recipeId":"nes.sum_of_roots.compose_kind","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"f6f1b295-8be4-5bfe-a339-99c2d049d978","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nes.sum_of_roots.chain2/sum_then_leading_coefficient","group":"nes.sum_of_roots.chain2","passage":"At the start of class, a tutor is working through a warm-up question at the whiteboard and tries a different approach. Let k represent the sum of the two solutions of $x^2 - 4x - 12 = 0$. Consider the second equation below, which uses k:\n\n$kx^2 + 16x + 1 = 0$","question":"What is the sum of the real solutions of the second equation?","options":["4","-64","-4","-16"],"correctIndex":2,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) 첫 방정식에서 두 근의 합은 -(-4) = 4 이므로 k = 4 이다. (2) 둘째 방정식에 k = 4 를 대입하면 $4x^2 + 16x + 1 = 0$ 이다. (3) 판별식 -16² - 4·4·1 = 240 > 0 이므로 서로 다른 두 실근이 있다. (4) 두 근의 합은 -(16) / 4 이다. (5) -16 / 4 = -4 이다. 따라서 정답은 -4이다.","explanationEn":"(1) The sum of the first equation's solutions is k. (2) Substitute k. (3) Check that real solutions exist. (4) Use -b/a. (5) Divide. So the answer is -4.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T15:23:58.055Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["앞 단계 결과가 뒤 방정식의 최고차 계수가 되고, 근이 무리수일 수 있어 합을 근과 계수의 관계로 읽어야 한다 — medium 은 한 방정식의 합"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nes.sum_of_roots.chain2","operator":"chain2","kind":"sum_of_roots","extraThinking":"앞 단계 결과가 뒤 방정식의 최고차 계수가 되고, 근이 무리수일 수 있어 합을 근과 계수의 관계로 읽어야 한다 — medium 은 한 방정식의 합","concepts":["근과 계수의 관계","연쇄 대입","판별식으로 실근 확인"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":2,"seed":810000,"variant":"sum_then_leading_coefficient","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":-4,"correctOption":"-4"},"runId":"sat-math-harder-20261020","gid":"f6f1b295-8be4-5bfe-a339-99c2d049d978","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","recipeId":"nes.sum_of_roots.chain2","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"0219c67c-3bd4-5480-a6bf-55a85055cad6","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nes.product_of_roots.inverse/leading_coefficient_inverse","group":"nes.product_of_roots.inverse","passage":"At the start of class, a study group is reviewing a homework item at the whiteboard and wants to double-check the result. In the equation given here, k is a positive integer, and the equation has two real solutions whose product is 35.\n\n$kx^2 - 36x + 105 = 0$","question":"What is the value of the sum of the solutions?","options":["36","12","-12","3"],"correctIndex":1,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) 근의 곱은 c/k = 105/k 이고 이것이 35 이다. (2) 105/k = 35 이므로 k = 3 이다. (3) k = 3 를 대입한 방정식은 $3x^2 - 36x + 105 = 0$ 이다. (4) 근의 합은 -(-36) / 3 이다. (5) 36 / 3 = 12 이다. 따라서 정답은 12이다.","explanationEn":"(1) The product of solutions is c over the leading coefficient. (2) Solve for k. (3) Write the equation with k known. (4) Use -b/a for the sum. (5) Divide. So the answer is 12.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T15:23:58.055Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["곱 조건으로 최고차 계수를 역산한 뒤 그 계수로 합을 다시 계산 — medium 은 최고차 계수가 숫자인 방정식에서 곱을 읽음"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nes.product_of_roots.inverse","operator":"inverse","kind":"product_of_roots","extraThinking":"곱 조건으로 최고차 계수를 역산한 뒤 그 계수로 합을 다시 계산 — medium 은 최고차 계수가 숫자인 방정식에서 곱을 읽음","concepts":["근과 계수의 관계(곱)","최고차 계수 역산","근과 계수의 관계(합)"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":2,"seed":810000,"variant":"leading_coefficient_inverse","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":12,"correctOption":"12"},"runId":"sat-math-harder-20261020","gid":"0219c67c-3bd4-5480-a6bf-55a85055cad6","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","recipeId":"nes.product_of_roots.inverse","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"7e9ed4f2-004c-5f6a-ac3a-23ec6a6cda15","subject":"SAT Math","format":"spr","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nes.product_of_roots.param_condition/param_product_condition","group":"nes.product_of_roots.param_condition","passage":"In a practice session, a club advisor is presenting a practice problem with a partner and tries a different approach. For the equation shown, k is a constant. The equation has two real solutions, and the product of the solutions is -12.\n\n$x^2 - (2k + 7)x + (k - 8) = 0$","question":"Find the larger of the two solutions.","options":null,"correctIndex":null,"answers":["3"],"explanation":"(1) 이차항의 계수가 1 이므로 두 근의 곱은 상수항과 같다. (2) k - 8 = -12 로 놓고 풀면 k = -4 이다. (3) x 의 계수에 k 를 대입하면 2·(-4) + 7 = -1 이다. (4) 방정식은 $x^2 + x - 12 = 0$ 이다. (5) 인수분해하면 x = -4 또는 x = 3 이므로 큰 근은 3 이다. 따라서 정답은 3이다.","explanationEn":"(1) The product of solutions is the constant term. (2) Solve for k. (3) Substitute k into the linear coefficient. (4) Write the equation with k known. (5) Factor and pick the larger solution. So the answer is 3.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T15:23:58.055Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["곱 조건 → k → 계수 대입 → 인수분해의 순서로 한 방정식을 두 번 쓴다 — medium 은 계수가 숫자인 방정식의 곱"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nes.product_of_roots.param_condition","operator":"param_condition","kind":"product_of_roots","extraThinking":"곱 조건 → k → 계수 대입 → 인수분해의 순서로 한 방정식을 두 번 쓴다 — medium 은 계수가 숫자인 방정식의 곱","concepts":["근과 계수의 관계(곱)","매개변수 방정식","이차방정식 풀이"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":2,"seed":810000,"variant":"param_product_condition","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":3,"correctOption":"3"},"runId":"sat-math-harder-20261020","gid":"7e9ed4f2-004c-5f6a-ac3a-23ec6a6cda15","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","recipeId":"nes.product_of_roots.param_condition","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"2c8783a5-9380-58c3-a1dd-401b4e090f4d","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nes.product_of_roots.compose_kind/one_negative_t","group":"nes.product_of_roots.compose_kind","passage":"For extra practice, a math teacher is presenting a quiz question with a partner and is unsure where to begin. The equation below has at least two real solutions. $x^4 - 18x^2 - 175 = 0$","question":"Find the product of every real solution of the equation.","options":["-5","25","-25","-175"],"correctIndex":2,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) x² = t 로 치환하면 t 에 대한 이차방정식이 된다. (2) $t^2 - 18t - 175 = 0$ 을 인수분해해 t 의 근을 구한다. (3) t = 25 또는 t = -7 이다. x² = t 가 실수이려면 t ≥ 0 이어야 하므로 t = 25 만 쓴다. (4) 실근은 x = ±5 이다. (5) 모든 실근의 곱은 -25 이다. 따라서 정답은 -25이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Substitute t = x². (2) Factor the quadratic in t. (3) A negative t cannot equal x², so keep only the positive root. (4) List the real solutions. (5) Multiply them, keeping the signs. So the answer is -25.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T15:23:58.056Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["치환(이차식 꼴 발견), t 의 근의 부호에 따른 실근 선별, x = ±√t 의 곱 계산을 연결 — medium 은 이차방정식의 근의 곱"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nes.product_of_roots.compose_kind","operator":"compose_kind","kind":"product_of_roots","extraThinking":"치환(이차식 꼴 발견), t 의 근의 부호에 따른 실근 선별, x = ±√t 의 곱 계산을 연결 — medium 은 이차방정식의 근의 곱","concepts":["치환(x²=t)","근과 계수의 관계","실근 선별(음수 제곱 제외)"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":2,"seed":810000,"variant":"one_negative_t","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":-25,"correctOption":"-25"},"runId":"sat-math-harder-20261020","gid":"2c8783a5-9380-58c3-a1dd-401b4e090f4d","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","recipeId":"nes.product_of_roots.compose_kind","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"1ea6d0a1-6d8a-566c-a446-75017da47e0c","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nes.product_of_roots.chain2/product_then_sum_of_squares","group":"nes.product_of_roots.chain2","passage":"At the start of class, a club advisor is writing up a homework item for the class and is unsure where to begin. Suppose k equals the product of the solutions of $x^2 - 5x + 6 = 0$. A second equation is given below, where k is that product:\n\n$x^2 + (k - 2)x - 2k = 0$","question":"What is the value of the sum of the squares of the solutions of the second equation?","options":["36","16","4","40"],"correctIndex":3,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) 첫 방정식에서 두 근의 곱은 상수항 6 이므로 k = 6 이다. (2) 둘째 방정식에 k = 6 를 대입하면 $x^2 + (4)x - 12 = 0$ 이다. (3) 인수분해하면 $(x - 2)(x + 6) = 0$ 이므로 근은 2 과 -6 이다. (4) 두 근의 제곱의 합은 2² + (-6)² 이다. (5) 4 + 36 = 40 이다. 따라서 정답은 40이다.","explanationEn":"(1) The product of the first equation's solutions is k. (2) Substitute k. (3) Factor the second equation. (4) Square and add. (5) Compute. So the answer is 40.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T15:23:58.056Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["앞 단계의 곱이 뒤 방정식의 계수가 되고, 근을 구하거나 (합)²-2(곱) 로 제곱합을 계산하는 2단계 연쇄 — medium 은 한 방정식의 곱"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nes.product_of_roots.chain2","operator":"chain2","kind":"product_of_roots","extraThinking":"앞 단계의 곱이 뒤 방정식의 계수가 되고, 근을 구하거나 (합)²-2(곱) 로 제곱합을 계산하는 2단계 연쇄 — medium 은 한 방정식의 곱","concepts":["근과 계수의 관계","연쇄 대입","제곱의 합"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":2,"seed":810000,"variant":"product_then_sum_of_squares","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":40,"correctOption":"40"},"runId":"sat-math-harder-20261020","gid":"1ea6d0a1-6d8a-566c-a446-75017da47e0c","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","recipeId":"nes.product_of_roots.chain2","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"022a24cb-9c93-5e3c-a625-08cdd580ac94","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nes.num_real_solutions.param_condition/count_no_real","group":"nes.num_real_solutions.param_condition","passage":"For extra practice, a club advisor is grading a review exercise before an exam and hopes to explain it clearly. In the equation given here, k is an integer with 1 ≤ k ≤ 23.\n\n$x^2 + 8x + k = 0$","question":"For how many values of k does the equation have no real solution?","options":["7","23","6","8"],"correctIndex":0,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) x² 의 계수가 1 이므로 판별식은 D = b² - 4k 이다. (2) 실근이 없으려면 D < 0 이므로 64 - 4k < 0 이다. (3) 이를 풀면 k > 16 이다. (4) 17 ≤ k ≤ 23 인 정수를 센다. (5) 개수는 7 이다. 따라서 정답은 7이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Write the discriminant. (2) Translate the root condition into an inequality. (3) Solve the inequality, watching the boundary. (4) Count the integers in the allowed range. (5) State the count. So the answer is 7.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T15:23:58.057Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["판별식 부등식 D>0 (경계 D=0 제외)을 세워 범위 안의 정수 개수를 센다 — medium 은 주어진 방정식의 실근 개수(0·1·2)만 판정"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nes.num_real_solutions.param_condition","operator":"param_condition","kind":"num_real_solutions","extraThinking":"판별식 부등식 D>0 (경계 D=0 제외)을 세워 범위 안의 정수 개수를 센다 — medium 은 주어진 방정식의 실근 개수(0·1·2)만 판정","concepts":["판별식 부등식","정수 개수 세기","경계값 처리"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":3,"seed":810000,"variant":"count_no_real","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":7,"correctOption":"7"},"runId":"sat-math-harder-20261020","gid":"022a24cb-9c93-5e3c-a625-08cdd580ac94","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","recipeId":"nes.num_real_solutions.param_condition","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"41b33adb-c56b-52a1-a6cd-79c95f5383d2","subject":"SAT Math","format":"spr","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nes.num_real_solutions.constraint_select/overlap_possible","group":"nes.num_real_solutions.constraint_select","passage":"In a practice session, a teaching assistant is checking a worksheet problem before an exam and wants to double-check the result. Consider the equation below. $(x^2 - 25)(x^2 - 36) = 0$","question":"What is the number of distinct positive real solutions of the equation?","options":null,"correctIndex":null,"answers":["2"],"explanation":"(1) 곱이 0 이므로 두 인수 중 하나가 0 이다. (2) x² - 25 = 0 에서 x = ±5 이다. (3) $x^2 - 36 = 0$ 을 풀면 x = 6, -6 이다. (4) 모든 실근 중 양수만 모은다. (5) 겹치는 값을 한 번만 세어 서로 다른 양의 실근은 2 개이다. 따라서 정답은 2이다.","explanationEn":"(1) A product is zero when a factor is zero. (2) Solve the first factor. (3) Solve the second factor. (4) Keep only the positive solutions. (5) Count distinct positive solutions once each. So the answer is 2.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T15:23:58.057Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["양의 실근만 선별하고 두 인수의 근이 겹치는 경우를 제거(제약·중복 추적) — medium 은 한 이차방정식의 실근 개수"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nes.num_real_solutions.constraint_select","operator":"constraint_select","kind":"num_real_solutions","extraThinking":"양의 실근만 선별하고 두 인수의 근이 겹치는 경우를 제거(제약·중복 추적) — medium 은 한 이차방정식의 실근 개수","concepts":["곱의 영 인수분해","양수 조건","중복 해 제거"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":3,"seed":810000,"variant":"overlap_possible","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":2,"correctOption":"2"},"runId":"sat-math-harder-20261020","gid":"41b33adb-c56b-52a1-a6cd-79c95f5383d2","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","recipeId":"nes.num_real_solutions.constraint_select","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"e2ae1ff5-e4ea-554c-aac3-a927cfb04749","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nes.num_real_solutions.compose_kind/translation_intercepts","group":"nes.num_real_solutions.compose_kind","passage":"In a practice session, a club advisor is reviewing a warm-up question for the class and is unsure where to begin. The graph of the function f is shown by the equation below:\n\n$f(x) = x^2 + 8x - 2$\n\nThe graph of g is obtained by shifting the graph of f 5 units to the right and then 20 units up.","question":"How many times does the graph of g cross or touch the x-axis?","options":["1","2","3","0"],"correctIndex":3,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) f 의 꼭짓점의 y 좌표(최솟값)는 -2 - 64/4 = -18 이다. (2) 수평 이동은 x절편의 위치만 바꾸고 개수는 바꾸지 않는다. (3) 위로 20 이동하면 g 의 최솟값은 -18 + 20 = 2 이다. (4) 아래로 열린 포물선이 아니라 위로 열린 포물선(최고차 계수 1 > 0)이다. (5) 최솟값이 양수 이므로 x절편은 0 개이다. 따라서 정답은 0이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Find the minimum value of f. (2) A horizontal shift moves the intercepts but does not change how many there are. (3) Apply the vertical shift to the minimum. (4) The parabola opens upward. (5) Decide the number of x-intercepts from the sign of the minimum. So the answer is 0.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T15:23:58.057Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["도형 이동(그래프 변환)과 실근 개수 개념을 연결하고 수평 이동은 개수에 영향을 주지 않음을 구분 — medium 은 방정식의 판별식 부호 판정"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nes.num_real_solutions.compose_kind","operator":"compose_kind","kind":"num_real_solutions","extraThinking":"도형 이동(그래프 변환)과 실근 개수 개념을 연결하고 수평 이동은 개수에 영향을 주지 않음을 구분 — medium 은 방정식의 판별식 부호 판정","concepts":["그래프 평행이동","꼭짓점(최솟값)","x절편과 실근 개수"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":3,"seed":810000,"variant":"translation_intercepts","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":0,"correctOption":"0"},"runId":"sat-math-harder-20261020","gid":"e2ae1ff5-e4ea-554c-aac3-a927cfb04749","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","recipeId":"nes.num_real_solutions.compose_kind","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"b9d74fdc-5d5f-5740-aadd-b8cbaa39beb8","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nes.num_real_solutions.compare_scenarios/union_of_solution_sets","group":"nes.num_real_solutions.compare_scenarios","passage":"At the start of class, a quiz writer is presenting an old test item before an exam and wants to see a clean solution. Two equations are given below:\n\nEquation 1: $x^2 - 16 = 0$\n\nEquation 2: $x^2 - 3x - 18 = 0$","question":"How many different real numbers are a solution to at least one of the two equations?","options":["5","3","4","2"],"correctIndex":2,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) Equation 1 을 풀면 x = -4, 4 이다. (2) Equation 2 의 판별식 9 - 4·(-18) = 81 의 부호를 확인한다. (3) Equation 2 의 실근: -3 와 6. (4) 두 해 집합을 합하되 같은 값은 한 번만 센다. (5) 서로 다른 실수 해는 4 개이다. 따라서 정답은 4이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Solve Equation 1. (2) Check the discriminant of Equation 2. (3) Solve Equation 2 over the reals. (4) Combine the two solution sets without double counting. (5) Count the distinct numbers. So the answer is 4.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T15:23:58.057Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["두 경우의 해 집합을 모두 구해 비교하고 겹치는 해를 한 번만 세어야 한다 — medium 은 한 방정식의 실근 개수"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nes.num_real_solutions.compare_scenarios","operator":"compare_scenarios","kind":"num_real_solutions","extraThinking":"두 경우의 해 집합을 모두 구해 비교하고 겹치는 해를 한 번만 세어야 한다 — medium 은 한 방정식의 실근 개수","concepts":["이차방정식 풀이","해 집합 비교","합집합의 원소 수"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":3,"seed":810000,"variant":"union_of_solution_sets","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":4,"correctOption":"4"},"runId":"sat-math-harder-20261020","gid":"b9d74fdc-5d5f-5740-aadd-b8cbaa39beb8","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","recipeId":"nes.num_real_solutions.compare_scenarios","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"f8ab0a33-47ee-56ba-ad4f-e21b7eadf36f","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nes.irrational_sum_of_roots.inverse/conjugate_sum","group":"nes.irrational_sum_of_roots.inverse","passage":"For extra practice, an instructor is preparing an old test item at the whiteboard and is unsure where to begin. The equation $x^2 + bx + c = 0$, where b and c are integers, are $-5 \\pm 3\\sqrt{7}$.","question":"What is the sum of b and c?","options":["10","-38","-48","-28"],"correctIndex":3,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) 계수가 정수이므로 두 해는 켤레 p ± q√n 이다: -5 ± 3√7. (2) 두 해의 합은 2·(-5) = -10 이고 이것은 -b 이다. (3) b = 10 이다. (4) 두 해의 곱은 (-5)² - (3√7)² = 25 - 63 = -38 이고 이것이 c 이다. (5) b + c = 10 + (-38) = -28 이다. 따라서 정답은 -28이다.","explanationEn":"(1) The solutions are a conjugate pair. (2) The sum of the solutions is minus the linear coefficient. (3) Solve for the linear coefficient. (4) The product of conjugates is p² - q²n. (5) Combine. So the answer is -28.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T15:23:58.057Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["해에서 계수로 역방향 재구성(켤레근의 합 2p, 곱 p²-q²n 의 부호 처리) — medium 은 무리수 근 방정식의 근의 합 -b/a 를 읽음"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nes.irrational_sum_of_roots.inverse","operator":"inverse","kind":"irrational_sum_of_roots","extraThinking":"해에서 계수로 역방향 재구성(켤레근의 합 2p, 곱 p²-q²n 의 부호 처리) — medium 은 무리수 근 방정식의 근의 합 -b/a 를 읽음","concepts":["켤레근","근과 계수의 관계","근호 제곱 계산"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":3,"seed":810000,"variant":"conjugate_sum","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":-28,"correctOption":"-28"},"runId":"sat-math-harder-20261020","gid":"f8ab0a33-47ee-56ba-ad4f-e21b7eadf36f","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","recipeId":"nes.irrational_sum_of_roots.inverse","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"8c7f0f62-d5f8-5760-ac06-be22276b6d21","subject":"SAT Math","format":"spr","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nes.irrational_sum_of_roots.compose_kind/sum_of_squares","group":"nes.irrational_sum_of_roots.compose_kind","passage":"At the start of class, a textbook author is working through a practice problem during a study session and wants to double-check the result. Consider the equation below, which has two real solutions, and neither solution is an integer.\n\n$x^2 + 9x - 2 = 0$","question":"What is the value of the sum of the squares of the solutions?","options":null,"correctIndex":null,"answers":["85"],"explanation":"(1) 판별식 81 - 4·(-2) = 89 > 0 이고 완전제곱수가 아니므로 해는 서로 다른 무리수이다. (2) 두 해의 합 r + s = -9, 곱 rs = -2 이다. (3) r² + s² = (r + s)² - 2rs 를 이용한다. (4) 81 - 2·(-2) 를 계산한다. (5) 결과는 85 이다. 따라서 정답은 85이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Check the discriminant: two irrational real solutions. (2) Vieta's formulas. (3) Use the symmetric identity. (4) Substitute the sum and product. (5) Evaluate. So the answer is 85.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T15:23:58.057Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["근과 계수의 관계에 대칭식 항등식((r+s)²-2rs, (r-s)²=(r+s)²-4rs)을 결합 — medium 은 근의 합만 읽음"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nes.irrational_sum_of_roots.compose_kind","operator":"compose_kind","kind":"irrational_sum_of_roots","extraThinking":"근과 계수의 관계에 대칭식 항등식((r+s)²-2rs, (r-s)²=(r+s)²-4rs)을 결합 — medium 은 근의 합만 읽음","concepts":["근과 계수의 관계","대칭식 항등식","판별식으로 실근 확인"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":3,"seed":810000,"variant":"sum_of_squares","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":85,"correctOption":"85"},"runId":"sat-math-harder-20261020","gid":"8c7f0f62-d5f8-5760-ac06-be22276b6d21","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","recipeId":"nes.irrational_sum_of_roots.compose_kind","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"1088709f-7e26-5088-aec6-1e9f7c7c4c2f","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nes.irrational_sum_of_roots.chain2/sum_then_sum_of_squares","group":"nes.irrational_sum_of_roots.chain2","passage":"Today, a textbook author is writing up a homework item during a study session and plans to post the answer later. Let k be the sum of the solutions of the equation $2x^2 + 2x - 2 = 0$. Consider the second equation below, which uses k:\n\n$x^2 - 3x - k = 0$","question":"Find the sum of the squares of the two solutions of the second equation.","options":["9","11","7","-1"],"correctIndex":2,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) 첫 방정식의 판별식 4 - 4·2·(-2) = 20 는 완전제곱수가 아니므로 해는 무리수이다. 해를 구하지 않고 합을 쓴다. (2) 두 해의 합은 -(2)/2 = -1 이므로 k = -1 이다. (3) 둘째 방정식은 $x^2 - 3x + 1 = 0$ 이므로 합 3, 곱 1 이다. (4) 제곱합은 (합)² - 2(곱) 이다. (5) 3² - 2·(1) = 9 + (-2) = 7 이다. 따라서 정답은 7이다.","explanationEn":"(1) The roots are irrational, so use the sum formula instead of solving. (2) Compute k. (3) Substitute k into the second equation. (4) Use the sum-of-squares identity. (5) Compute. So the answer is 7.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T15:23:58.058Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["근을 구하지 않고 앞 단계의 합이 뒤 방정식의 상수항이 되는 2단계 연쇄, 제곱합 항등식 재사용 — medium 은 한 방정식의 합"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nes.irrational_sum_of_roots.chain2","operator":"chain2","kind":"irrational_sum_of_roots","extraThinking":"근을 구하지 않고 앞 단계의 합이 뒤 방정식의 상수항이 되는 2단계 연쇄, 제곱합 항등식 재사용 — medium 은 한 방정식의 합","concepts":["근과 계수의 관계","연쇄 대입","제곱합 항등식"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":3,"seed":810000,"variant":"sum_then_sum_of_squares","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":7,"correctOption":"7"},"runId":"sat-math-harder-20261020","gid":"1088709f-7e26-5088-aec6-1e9f7c7c4c2f","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","recipeId":"nes.irrational_sum_of_roots.chain2","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"f5b46957-dad0-5f1e-a136-dc14637fef88","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nes.irrational_sum_of_roots.repr_shift/area_equation_sum","group":"nes.irrational_sum_of_roots.repr_shift","passage":"As part of a unit review, a tutor is revising an old test item with a partner and is unsure where to begin. A rectangular garden has a width of w meters. Its length is 6 less than twice the width, and its area is 97 square meters. Writing the area condition as an equation in w gives a quadratic equation.","question":"What is the sum of the two solutions of this quadratic equation (including any solution that does not make sense as a width)?","options":["6","3","4","-3"],"correctIndex":1,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) 가로가 w, 세로가 6 less than twice the width 이므로 세로는 2w - 6 이다. (2) 넓이 = 가로 × 세로 이므로 $w(2w - 6) = 97$ 이다. (3) 전개해 표준형으로 정리하면 $2w^2 - 6w - 97 = 0$ 이다. (4) 판별식 36 + 776 = 812 > 0 이므로 서로 다른 두 실근이 있다. (5) 두 근의 합은 -(-6)/2 = 3 이다. 따라서 정답은 3이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Write the length in terms of w. (2) Area is width times length. (3) Expand and move everything to one side. (4) Two real solutions exist. (5) Use -b/a. So the answer is 3.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T15:23:58.058Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["문장(넓이 조건)을 식으로 모델링해 표준형으로 정리한 뒤, 도형에서는 의미 없는 근까지 포함한 근의 합을 읽음 — medium 은 이미 식으로 주어진 방정식의 합"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nes.irrational_sum_of_roots.repr_shift","operator":"repr_shift","kind":"irrational_sum_of_roots","extraThinking":"문장(넓이 조건)을 식으로 모델링해 표준형으로 정리한 뒤, 도형에서는 의미 없는 근까지 포함한 근의 합을 읽음 — medium 은 이미 식으로 주어진 방정식의 합","concepts":["도형 문장의 식 세우기(넓이)","표준형 정리","근과 계수의 관계"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":3,"seed":810000,"variant":"area_equation_sum","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":3,"correctOption":"3"},"runId":"sat-math-harder-20261020","gid":"f5b46957-dad0-5f1e-a136-dc14637fef88","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","recipeId":"nes.irrational_sum_of_roots.repr_shift","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"436a7666-b897-52f2-ad0e-ee02c5b3d2d2","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Algebra (선형식·연립·부등식)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"linear_equations_two_var","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"l2.intersection_x.compose_kind/point_slope_then_intersect","group":"l2.intersection_x.compose_kind","passage":"Line j has slope -1 and passes through the point $(3, 20)$. Line k is the graph of $y = -5x - 1$.","question":"What is the x-coordinate of the intersection of j and k?","options":["-5","6","-6","29"],"correctIndex":2,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) j 는 점 (3, 20) 를 지나고 기울기가 -1 이므로 $y - 20 = -1(x - 3)$ 이다. (2) 정리하면 $y = -x + 23$ 이다. (3) 교점에서 두 y 가 같으므로 $-x + 23 = -5x - 1$ 이다. (4) x 항을 모으면 $4x = -24$ 이다. (5) 4 로 나누면 x = -6 이다. 따라서 정답은 -6이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Write line 1 in point-slope form. (2) Convert to slope-intercept form. (3) Set the two y-values equal. (4) Collect the x-terms. (5) Solve for x. So the answer is -6.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T15:23:58.058Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":