product. (5) Solve for the constant. So the answer is 1.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T15:23:58.058Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["해(교점의 x 좌표)에서 거꾸로 미지 상수를 결정 — medium 은 두 식이 모두 주어진 연립에서 x 를 구함"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"l2.intersection_x.inverse","operator":"inverse","kind":"intersection_x","extraThinking":"해(교점의 x 좌표)에서 거꾸로 미지 상수를 결정 — medium 은 두 식이 모두 주어진 연립에서 x 를 구함","concepts":["연립방정식의 해의 의미","미지 상수 역산"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":4,"seed":810000,"variant":"unknown_constant_from_x","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":1,"correctOption":"1"},"runId":"sat-math-harder-20261020","gid":"e3b29c72-91bf-5b5c-ab94-6d2f5f3e13d0","intendedSkill":"linear_equations_two_var","recipeId":"l2.intersection_x.inverse","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":2,"minMet":2,"of":2,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"4f0e40cb-a88d-515f-ad5b-5ffc01ec4bdd","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Algebra (선형식·연립·부등식)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"linear_equations_two_var","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"l2.intersection_x.compare_scenarios/equal_cost_point","group":"l2.intersection_x.compare_scenarios","passage":"At Company A, a deposit costs 50 dollars and each day adds 9 dollars. At Company B, a deposit costs 86 dollars and each day adds 6 dollars. The graphs of the two cost equations are lines in the xy-plane.","question":"The two cost lines intersect at what number of days?","options":["36","9","12","2"],"correctIndex":2,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) Company A 의 비용은 $9n + 50$ 이다. (2) Company B 의 비용은 $6n + 86$ 이다. (3) 같아지려면 $9n + 50 = 6n + 86$ 이다. (4) n 항을 모으면 $3n = 36$ 이다. (5) 3 로 나누면 n = 12 이다. 따라서 정답은 12이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Model company A. (2) Model company B. (3) Set the totals equal. (4) Collect the n-terms. (5) Solve for n. So the answer is 12.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T15:23:58.059Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["두 상황을 각각 식으로 세우고 같아지는 시점(교점)을 구함 — medium 은 두 식이 주어진 연립"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"l2.intersection_x.compare_scenarios","operator":"compare_scenarios","kind":"intersection_x","extraThinking":"두 상황을 각각 식으로 세우고 같아지는 시점(교점)을 구함 — medium 은 두 식이 주어진 연립","concepts":["문장→일차식","연립방정식의 교점"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":4,"seed":810000,"variant":"equal_cost_point","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":12,"correctOption":"12"},"runId":"sat-math-harder-20261020","gid":"4f0e40cb-a88d-515f-ad5b-5ffc01ec4bdd","intendedSkill":"linear_equations_two_var","recipeId":"l2.intersection_x.compare_scenarios","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":2,"minMet":2,"of":2,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"b4571575-0206-56aa-a8e6-1b7daaa6f43e","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Algebra (선형식·연립·부등식)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"linear_equations_two_var","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"l2.intersection_x.repr_shift/lines_from_tables","group":"l2.intersection_x.repr_shift","passage":"The values of two linear functions are recorded below. Line A passes through $(3, 20)$ and $(7, 40)$. Line B passes through $(2, 15)$ and $(6, 27)$.","question":"What is the x-coordinate of the point where the two lines intersect?","options":["2","15","-2","0"],"correctIndex":0,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) A 의 기울기는 5, y 절편은 5 이므로 $y = 5x + 5$ 이다. (2) B 의 기울기는 3, y 절편은 9 이므로 $y = 3x + 9$ 이다. (3) $5x + 5 = 3x + 9$ 로 놓는다. (4) x 항을 모으면 $2x = 4$ 이다. (5) 2 로 나누면 x = 2 이다. 따라서 정답은 2이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Restore line A. (2) Restore line B. (3) Set the y-values equal. (4) Collect the x-terms. (5) Solve for x. So the answer is 2.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T15:23:58.059Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["표(두 점)를 직선의 식으로 번역한 뒤 연립으로 교점을 구함 — medium 은 두 식이 주어진 연립"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"l2.intersection_x.repr_shift","operator":"repr_shift","kind":"intersection_x","extraThinking":"표(두 점)를 직선의 식으로 번역한 뒤 연립으로 교점을 구함 — medium 은 두 식이 주어진 연립","concepts":["표→직선의 식","연립방정식의 교점"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":4,"seed":810000,"variant":"lines_from_tables","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":2,"correctOption":"2"},"runId":"sat-math-harder-20261020","gid":"b4571575-0206-56aa-a8e6-1b7daaa6f43e","intendedSkill":"linear_equations_two_var","recipeId":"l2.intersection_x.repr_shift","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":2,"minMet":2,"of":2,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"97f3016d-11dc-517a-a5ce-a7cf4e5988b2","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Algebra (선형식·연립·부등식)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"linear_equations_two_var","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"l2.intersection_y.chain2/third_line_at_intersection_x","group":"l2.intersection_y.chain2","passage":"The graphs of A and B are the lines with the equations below.\n\n$A: y = -4x + 7$\n$B: y = 4x + 31$\n\nLine C is given by $y = x - 7$. A point on line C has the same x-coordinate as the intersection of A and B.","question":"What is the y-coordinate of that point on line C?","options":["-3","12","-10","19"],"correctIndex":2,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) A 와 B 가 만나는 점에서 $-4x + 7 = 4x + 31$ 이다. (2) x 항을 모으면 $-8x = 24$ 이다. (3) x = -3 이다. (4) C 의 같은 x 에서 $y = 1\\cdot (-3) - 7$ 이다. (5) y = -10 이다. 따라서 정답은 -10이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Set A equal to B. (2) Collect the x-terms. (3) Solve for x. (4) Substitute into C. (5) Evaluate. So the answer is -10.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T15:23:58.059Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["교점에서 얻은 x 를 다음 직선의 입력으로 쓰는 2단계 연쇄 — medium 은 교점의 y 좌표 하나"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"l2.intersection_y.chain2","operator":"chain2","kind":"intersection_y","extraThinking":"교점에서 얻은 x 를 다음 직선의 입력으로 쓰는 2단계 연쇄 — medium 은 교점의 y 좌표 하나","concepts":["연립방정식의 교점","일차함수의 함수값"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":4,"seed":810000,"variant":"third_line_at_intersection_x","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":-10,"correctOption":"-10"},"runId":"sat-math-harder-20261020","gid":"97f3016d-11dc-517a-a5ce-a7cf4e5988b2","intendedSkill":"linear_equations_two_var","recipeId":"l2.intersection_y.chain2","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":2,"minMet":2,"of":2,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"e8993620-0e97-58e0-a5b3-1ced4752aa35","subject":"SAT Math","format":"spr","skillType":"Algebra (선형식·연립·부등식)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"linear_equations_two_var","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"l2.intersection_y.inverse/unknown_constant_from_y","group":"l2.intersection_y.inverse","passage":"In the system below, k is a constant. The solution $(x, y)$ satisfies $y = -4$.\n\n$y = 2x + 2$\n$y = x + k$","question":"What is the value of k?","options":null,"correctIndex":null,"answers":["-1"],"explanation":"(1) y = -4 을 첫 식에 대입하면 $-4 = 2x + 2$ 이다. (2) 상수를 이항하면 $2x = -6$ 이다. (3) x = -3 이다. (4) 해 (-3, -4) 가 둘째 식도 만족한다: -4 = 1·(-3) + K. (5) K = -4 - (-3) = -1 이다. 따라서 정답은 -1이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Substitute y into the first equation. (2) Isolate the x-term. (3) Solve for x. (4) Substitute into the second equation. (5) Solve for the constant. So the answer is -1.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T15:23:58.060Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["y 좌표에서 x 좌표를 거꾸로 구한 뒤 미지 상수를 결정하는 2단계 역산 — medium 은 두 식이 주어진 연립에서 y 를 구함"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"l2.intersection_y.inverse","operator":"inverse","kind":"intersection_y","extraThinking":"y 좌표에서 x 좌표를 거꾸로 구한 뒤 미지 상수를 결정하는 2단계 역산 — medium 은 두 식이 주어진 연립에서 y 를 구함","concepts":["연립방정식의 해의 의미","미지 상수 역산"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":4,"seed":810000,"variant":"unknown_constant_from_y","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":-1,"correctOption":"-1"},"runId":"sat-math-harder-20261020","gid":"e8993620-0e97-58e0-a5b3-1ced4752aa35","intendedSkill":"linear_equations_two_var","recipeId":"l2.intersection_y.inverse","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":2,"minMet":2,"of":2,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"48aa8bd2-1eb5-5286-ab50-7c930bf810c8","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Algebra (선형식·연립·부등식)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"linear_equations_two_var","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"l2.intersection_y.constraint_select/integer_solutions_sum_of_y","group":"l2.intersection_y.constraint_select","passage":"For the system below, k is an integer with 1 ≤ k ≤ 14. Look only at the values of k for which x and y are both integers.\n\n$y = kx + 5$\n$y = -x + 21$","question":"Adding the y-coordinates of the solutions for all such values of k gives what sum?","options":["3","11","30","49"],"correctIndex":3,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) 두 식에서 $kx + 5 = -x + 21$ 이므로 $(k + 1)x = 16$ 이다. (2) x = 16/(k - (-1)) 이 정수여야 한다. (3) 16 의 약수 조건에서 1 ≤ k ≤ 14 인 k 는 1, 3, 7 이다. (4) 각 k 에서 y = -1x + 21 로 y 좌표는 13, 17, 19 이다. (5) 합은 49 이다. 따라서 정답은 49이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Set the equations equal. (2) x must be an integer. (3) List the valid k. (4) Compute each y-coordinate. (5) Add. So the answer is 49.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T15:23:58.060Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["k 마다 교점의 x = (c−b)/(k−m) 이 정수가 되는지(약수 조건)를 따져 후보를 고르고 각 y 좌표를 합산 — medium 은 교점의 y 좌표 하나"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"l2.intersection_y.constraint_select","operator":"constraint_select","kind":"intersection_y","extraThinking":"k 마다 교점의 x = (c−b)/(k−m) 이 정수가 되는지(약수 조건)를 따져 후보를 고르고 각 y 좌표를 합산 — medium 은 교점의 y 좌표 하나","concepts":["연립방정식의 교점","약수 조건(정수 해)","후보 선택과 합산"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":4,"seed":810000,"variant":"integer_solutions_sum_of_y","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":49,"correctOption":"49"},"runId":"sat-math-harder-20261020","gid":"48aa8bd2-1eb5-5286-ab50-7c930bf810c8","intendedSkill":"linear_equations_two_var","recipeId":"l2.intersection_y.constraint_select","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"fd8a19e8-e180-54ad-a0e1-e75592018e2c","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Algebra (선형식·연립·부등식)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"linear_equations_two_var","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"l2.intersection_y.compose_kind/two_points_then_intersect_y","group":"l2.intersection_y.compose_kind","passage":"Line ℓ passes through the points $(3, -14)$ and $(4, -13)$. A second line, m, satisfies $y = 5x - 1$.","question":"At what y-value do lines ℓ and m intersect?","options":["-17","-21","21","-4"],"correctIndex":1,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) ℓ 의 기울기는 (-13 - (-14)) / (4 - 3) = 1 이다. (2) 점 (3, -14) 를 대입해 절편을 구하면 $y = x - 17$ 이다. (3) 교점에서 $x - 17 = 5x - 1$ 이다. (4) x 항을 모으면 $-4x = 16$ 이므로 x = -4 이다. (5) m 에 대입하면 y = 5·(-4) + (-1) = -21 이다. 따라서 정답은 -21이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Find the slope of ℓ. (2) Find the intercept. (3) Set the y-values equal. (4) Solve for x. (5) Compute y. So the answer is -21.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T15:23:58.060Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["두 점에서 기울기·식을 복원한 뒤 연립으로 교점의 y 좌표를 구하는 합성 — medium 은 두 식이 주어진 연립에서 y 를 구함"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"l2.intersection_y.compose_kind","operator":"compose_kind","kind":"intersection_y","extraThinking":"두 점에서 기울기·식을 복원한 뒤 연립으로 교점의 y 좌표를 구하는 합성 — medium 은 두 식이 주어진 연립에서 y 를 구함","concepts":["두 점으로 직선의 식","연립방정식의 교점"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":4,"seed":810000,"variant":"two_points_then_intersect_y","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":-21,"correctOption":"-21"},"runId":"sat-math-harder-20261020","gid":"fd8a19e8-e180-54ad-a0e1-e75592018e2c","intendedSkill":"linear_equations_two_var","recipeId":"l2.intersection_y.compose_kind","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":2,"minMet":2,"of":2,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"e6c0e1b4-5002-52a7-ac6a-d54c4d8499df","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Algebra (선형식·연립·부등식)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"linear_equations_two_var","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"l2.intersection_sum.param_condition/solution_on_y_equals_x","group":"l2.intersection_sum.param_condition","passage":"In the system below, p is a constant. The solution $(x, y)$ of the system lies on the line $y = x$.\n\n$y = 3x + 4$\n$y = px - 8$","question":"What is the value of p?","options":["-2","-3","3","5"],"correctIndex":1,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) x = y 이므로 첫 식에 y 대신 x 를 넣으면 $x = 3x + 4$ 이다. (2) 정리하면 $-2x = 4$ 이다. (3) x = -2, y = -2 이다. (4) 둘째 식에 대입하면 -2 = p·(-2) + (-8) 이다. (5) K = (-2 - (-8)) / (-2) = -3 이다. 따라서 정답은 -3이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Use y = x in the first equation. (2) Collect the x-terms. (3) Solve for the solution. (4) Substitute into the second equation. (5) Solve for the constant. So the answer is -3.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T15:23:58.060Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["'해가 y = x 위에 있다'는 암묵 조건(x = y)을 식으로 번역해 미지 계수 k 를 결정 — medium 은 두 식이 주어진 연립에서 x + y 를 구함"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"l2.intersection_sum.param_condition","operator":"param_condition","kind":"intersection_sum","extraThinking":"'해가 y = x 위에 있다'는 암묵 조건(x = y)을 식으로 번역해 미지 계수 k 를 결정 — medium 은 두 식이 주어진 연립에서 x + y 를 구함","concepts":["연립방정식의 해","해의 조건(x = y)","미지 계수 결정"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":4,"seed":810000,"variant":"solution_on_y_equals_x","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":-3,"correctOption":"-3"},"runId":"sat-math-harder-20261020","gid":"e6c0e1b4-5002-52a7-ac6a-d54c4d8499df","intendedSkill":"linear_equations_two_var","recipeId":"l2.intersection_sum.param_condition","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"aff7b288-d64a-5606-a3d2-6bf91ce20563","subject":"SAT Math","format":"spr","skillType":"Algebra (선형식·연립·부등식)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"linear_equations_two_var","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"l2.intersection_sum.inverse/unknown_constant_from_coordinate_sum","group":"l2.intersection_sum.inverse","passage":"The system below has a constant k. For the solution $(x, y)$, $x + y = 19$.\n\n$y = 4x - 1$\n$y = x + k$","question":"What must k equal?","options":null,"correctIndex":null,"answers":["11"],"explanation":"(1) 첫 식의 y = 4x - 1 를 x + y = 19 에 대입한다. (2) $x + 4x - 1 = 19$ 이므로 $5x = 20$ 이다. (3) x = 4 이고 y = 15 이다. (4) 둘째 식에 대입하면 15 = 1·4 + K 이다. (5) K = 15 - 4 = 11 이다. 따라서 정답은 11이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Substitute the first equation into the sum. (2) Collect the x-terms. (3) Find the solution. (4) Substitute into the second equation. (5) Solve for the constant. So the answer is 11.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T15:23:58.061Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["해의 좌표 합이라는 간접 정보에서 해를 복원한 뒤 미지 상수를 결정 — medium 은 두 식이 주어진 연립에서 x + y 를 구함"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"l2.intersection_sum.inverse","operator":"inverse","kind":"intersection_sum","extraThinking":"해의 좌표 합이라는 간접 정보에서 해를 복원한 뒤 미지 상수를 결정 — medium 은 두 식이 주어진 연립에서 x + y 를 구함","concepts":["연립방정식의 해","합 조건으로 해 복원","미지 상수 역산"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":4,"seed":810000,"variant":"unknown_constant_from_coordinate_sum","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":11,"correctOption":"11"},"runId":"sat-math-harder-20261020","gid":"aff7b288-d64a-5606-a3d2-6bf91ce20563","intendedSkill":"linear_equations_two_var","recipeId":"l2.intersection_sum.inverse","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"64cad8d8-882e-5b98-aaaa-9a951e701036","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Algebra (선형식·연립·부등식)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"linear_equations_two_var","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"l2.intersection_sum.compose_kind/symmetric_system_sum","group":"l2.intersection_sum.compose_kind","passage":"A student is solving the system of equations below.\n\n$7x + 5y = 1$\n$5x + 7y = -13$","question":"What is the sum of the x-coordinate and the y-coordinate of the solution?","options":["-6","-1","-12","7"],"correctIndex":1,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) 두 식을 더하면 $12x + 12y = -12$ 이다. (2) $12(x + y) = -12$ 로 묶는다. (3) 12 로 나누면 x + y = -1 이다. (4) 검산: 두 식을 빼면 $2x - 2y = 14$ 이므로 x - y = 7 이다. (5) x = 3, y = -4 이고 x + y = -1 이다. 따라서 정답은 -1이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Add the equations. (2) Factor out the common coefficient. (3) Divide. (4) Check by subtracting. (5) Confirm the solution. So the answer is -1.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T15:23:58.061Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["두 식을 더해 (p+q)(x+y) 로 묶는 구조 발견(소거와 합의 합성) — medium 은 해를 구한 뒤 더하는 방식"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"l2.intersection_sum.compose_kind","operator":"compose_kind","kind":"intersection_sum","extraThinking":"두 식을 더해 (p+q)(x+y) 로 묶는 구조 발견(소거와 합의 합성) — medium 은 해를 구한 뒤 더하는 방식","concepts":["연립방정식 소거","식의 합으로 묶기","해의 합"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":4,"seed":810000,"variant":"symmetric_system_sum","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":-1,"correctOption":"-1"},"runId":"sat-math-harder-20261020","gid":"64cad8d8-882e-5b98-aaaa-9a951e701036","intendedSkill":"linear_equations_two_var","recipeId":"l2.intersection_sum.compose_kind","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"ca2977e6-2385-5dd8-a637-b8773d1dfe14","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Algebra (선형식·연립·부등식)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"linear_equations_two_var","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"l2.intersection_sum.constraint_select/integer_solutions_sum_of_coordinates","group":"l2.intersection_sum.constraint_select","passage":"In the system below, the integer k satisfies 1 ≤ k ≤ 11. Some choices of k make both coordinates of the solution whole numbers.\n\n$y = kx - 5$\n$y = -x + 13$","question":"If x + y is recorded for each such k, what is the total?","options":["16","39","52","4"],"correctIndex":2,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) 두 식에서 $(k + 1)x = 18$ 이다. (2) x = 18/(k - (-1)) 이 정수여야 한다. (3) 18 의 약수 조건에서 1 ≤ k ≤ 11 인 k 는 1, 2, 5, 8 이다. (4) 각 k 에서 x + y 는 13, 13, 13, 13 이다. (5) 합은 52 이다. 따라서 정답은 52이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Set the equations equal. (2) x must be an integer. (3) List the valid k. (4) Compute each x + y. (5) Add. So the answer is 52.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T15:23:58.061Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["k 마다 x = (c−b)/(k−m) 이 정수인지 약수 조건으로 후보를 고르고 각 후보의 x + y 를 합산 — medium 은 교점의 x + y 하나"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"l2.intersection_sum.constraint_select","operator":"constraint_select","kind":"intersection_sum","extraThinking":"k 마다 x = (c−b)/(k−m) 이 정수인지 약수 조건으로 후보를 고르고 각 후보의 x + y 를 합산 — medium 은 교점의 x + y 하나","concepts":["연립방정식의 교점","약수 조건(정수 해)","후보 선택과 합산"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":4,"seed":810000,"variant":"integer_solutions_sum_of_coordinates","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":52,"correctOption":"52"},"runId":"sat-math-harder-20261020","gid":"ca2977e6-2385-5dd8-a637-b8773d1dfe14","intendedSkill":"linear_equations_two_var","recipeId":"l2.intersection_sum.constraint_select","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}}]$satx$::jsonb;
  v_actor uuid := (select id from profiles where role = 'admin' order by created_at limit 1);
  r jsonb; v_pid uuid; v_vid uuid; v_n int := 0; v_skip int := 0;
begin
  if v_actor is null then raise exception 'No admin profile found.'; end if;
  for r in select * from jsonb_array_elements(v_items) loop
    if exists (select 1 from problem_versions where quality->'mockExamGeneration'->>'gid' = r->>'gid') then v_skip := v_skip + 1; continue; end if;
    v_pid := public.create_bank_problem(p_subject_id => (select id from subjects where name = r->>'subject' and archived_at is null), p_format => r->>'format', p_skill_type => r->>'skillType', p_topic => '',
      p_difficulty => r->>'difficulty', p_actor_id => v_actor, p_skill_code => r->>'skill', p_exam_system => r->>'examSystem', p_ap_subject => null, p_usage_scope => 'mock_exam');
    update problems set created_via = r->>'createdVia', subpattern = coalesce(r->>'subpattern', subpattern), similarity_group = coalesce(r->>'group', similarity_group) where id = v_pid;
    v_vid := public.save_problem_draft_version(p_problem_id => v_pid, p_passage => r->>'passage', p_options => nullif(r->'options', 'null'::jsonb), p_correct_index => (r->>'correctIndex')::int, p_explanation => r->>'explanation',
      p_difficulty => r->>'difficulty', p_actor_id => v_actor, p_answers => nullif(r->'answers', 'null'::jsonb), p_figure => nullif(r->'figure', 'null'::jsonb), p_figure_checked => false, p_statements => nullif(r->'statements', 'null'::jsonb),
      p_question => r->>'question', p_repair_status => null, p_explanation_en => r->>'explanationEn', p_evidence_target => r->>'evidenceTarget', p_evidence_span => r->>'evidenceSpan', p_answer_rationale => r->>'answerRationale',
      p_distractor_error_types => nullif(r->'distractorErrorTypes', 'null'::jsonb));
    perform public.set_problem_render_check(v_vid, r->'renderCheck');
    perform public.set_problem_quality(v_vid, r->'quality');
    if (r->>'publish')::boolean then perform public.confirm_and_publish_problem_version(v_vid, v_actor); end if;
    v_n := v_n + 1;
  end loop;
  raise notice 'SAT Math hard import (math harder) 1/1: created=% skipped(existing)=%', v_n, v_skip;
end
$imp$;
